WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.460
Would you like some wine?

00:01.750 --> 00:03.240
Uh, w-well...

00:03.810 --> 00:05.360
Do you have oolong tea?

00:06.160 --> 00:07.850
Yes, I'll go prepare some.

00:07.850 --> 00:09.550
- I'll have cider!
- I'll have a Bireley's!

00:11.420 --> 00:12.490
How about you?

00:13.190 --> 00:15.190
I'll... I'll have a Bireley's, too.

00:15.190 --> 00:16.440
Another Bireley's, please!

00:19.140 --> 00:20.890
Cheers!

00:21.470 --> 00:24.560
Sounds like the bride
Naoko-san's quite the drinker...

00:24.560 --> 00:26.540
Bad news for the groom, Akagawa!

00:26.540 --> 00:28.790
His face is already beet red!

00:36.080 --> 00:38.580
Although I'm ashamed to
admit I was out of my element,

00:38.580 --> 00:41.080
I wanted to plunge into the
alluring world of adulthood.

00:41.080 --> 00:44.070
In other words, I wanted to not
be held back by my seniors

00:44.070 --> 00:46.550
and to drink as much as I possibly could!

01:06.400 --> 01:09.320
You're still not tired of staring at her?

01:09.480 --> 01:12.300
I... I was just looking that
way by chance, all right?

01:12.650 --> 01:14.610
I was completely head over heels for her.

01:14.610 --> 01:18.830
She had grabbed hold of my heart
when she joined my club as my junior,

01:18.830 --> 01:22.790
and ever since that day, I've committed
myself to the SEE Strategy!

01:20.080 --> 01:24.050
The SEE Strategy

01:26.820 --> 01:28.350
Senpai, what a coincidence!

01:28.350 --> 01:30.570
I was just passing through by chance!

01:32.080 --> 01:33.250
Such a coincidence!

01:33.250 --> 01:34.140
By chance!

01:35.250 --> 01:35.960
Coincidence...

01:35.960 --> 01:36.570
Chance!

01:36.570 --> 01:37.130
Coinc...

01:37.130 --> 01:37.580
Chance!

01:37.580 --> 01:37.830
Co...

01:37.830 --> 01:38.220
Chance!

01:38.380 --> 01:41.360
My goal was to appear in front
of her as frequently as possible,

01:41.600 --> 01:45.460
and thus, the SEE strategy involves
being Seen, Everytime, Everywhere.

01:44.420 --> 01:46.380
Seen, Everytime, Everywhere

01:45.460 --> 01:48.560
This ensures our meetings push
beyond the realm of mere chance,

01:48.560 --> 01:52.130
and she'll have no choice
but to feel the red string of fate!

01:52.130 --> 01:53.770
My chance is ripening!

01:53.770 --> 01:55.710
What I need now is the courage to wait!

01:55.710 --> 01:57.470
That's not exactly courage.

01:57.470 --> 01:59.650
Stop reading my mind!

01:59.650 --> 02:02.260
You're so obsessed over removing
obstacles in your path...

02:02.510 --> 02:06.150
Shall you live under the apple tree
you're planting beside yourself?

02:06.500 --> 02:09.540
The School Festival Executive Director,
and also, my friend.

02:06.910 --> 02:09.240
The School Festival Executive Director

02:09.800 --> 02:11.540
The most photographed person on campus,

02:11.540 --> 02:14.700
he receives the most Valentine's
chocolate in all Sakyo-ku.

02:14.700 --> 02:17.270
He also puts his beauty to
use through cross-dressing,

02:17.270 --> 02:21.400
and his infamy rose after confusing several
young men during the Fall Festival.

02:21.400 --> 02:22.790
You dithering fool!

02:22.790 --> 02:25.230
She's right in front of your face,
yet you do nothing!

02:25.800 --> 02:28.150
Hey now, you're drinking too much.

02:28.840 --> 02:29.980
Meet my other friend,

02:29.050 --> 02:42.010
Don Underwear

02:29.980 --> 02:34.290
who six months ago vowed to never change
his underwear until his wish came true.

02:34.290 --> 02:36.800
Despite smashing the
previous record for doing so,

02:36.800 --> 02:40.180
and earning the glorious
title of "Don Underwear",

02:40.180 --> 02:42.030
his wish is as yet unfulfilled.

02:42.030 --> 02:43.180
Leave it alone already!

02:43.180 --> 02:45.440
I'll strike when MY iron is hot!

02:46.020 --> 02:47.440
Your iron, huh...

02:49.980 --> 02:51.240
Tonight's my chance!

02:51.460 --> 02:54.340
If I sit at the same table as her
when we go to the next place,

02:54.340 --> 02:56.670
I can push things to
the next stage for sure!

03:05.010 --> 03:06.970
Not romantic!

03:07.170 --> 03:09.630
Now then, we'll be heading
off to the next pub!

03:09.630 --> 03:12.440
Anyone who is staying with
our group, please follow me!

03:12.440 --> 03:15.610
It will be a 3 minute walk,
so take care not to lose sight!

03:15.610 --> 03:16.850
You're all coming, right?

03:16.850 --> 03:17.970
Right?!

03:30.120 --> 03:31.980
In the neighborhood of Shijo-Kiyamachi,

03:31.980 --> 03:35.330
men and women indulging in evening
pleasures came in an incessant stream.

03:35.330 --> 03:37.410
Here of all places would have what I seek,

03:37.410 --> 03:39.670
an encounter with glorious alcohol!

03:39.670 --> 03:41.950
The dazzling world of adulthood awaits!

03:42.330 --> 03:49.610
The Night is Short, Walk On Girl

04:18.950 --> 04:20.460
One pina colada, please!

04:25.610 --> 04:27.810
I had a fondness for cocktails.

04:28.120 --> 04:31.970
Picking a cocktail was like
picking out a sparkling jewel,

04:31.970 --> 04:34.100
everything about it felt so luxurious.

04:45.640 --> 04:49.650
In all honesty, the entire Pacific
Ocean could be rum for all I care,

04:49.650 --> 04:51.430
that's how much I adore rum.

04:51.740 --> 04:54.940
I long to down the entire bottle
the second I lay hands on one,

04:54.940 --> 04:57.950
but this is the sort of dream
one best be discreet about.

04:58.540 --> 05:00.940
Hey you, looks like you
can hold your drink.

05:01.300 --> 05:02.940
Your next one's on me.

05:03.140 --> 05:04.520
Oh no! That's fine!

05:04.520 --> 05:06.730
Get this gal an Acapulco!

05:07.420 --> 05:10.050
Rum's made from sugarcane...

05:10.480 --> 05:14.050
Brandy was originally known
as vin brule, or "burnt wine".

05:14.050 --> 05:17.290
Once you distill wine,
the alcohol content skyrockets,

05:17.290 --> 05:19.580
and that's how you end up
with brandy and whisky.

05:19.770 --> 05:21.240
You certainly know a lot...

05:21.240 --> 05:23.000
Just part of gettin' old.

05:23.000 --> 05:25.080
I'm sorry I won't be able to keep up.

05:25.330 --> 05:28.800
Nah, spending time with
people I pass by in the night,

05:28.800 --> 05:30.650
that's where I find my joy.

05:33.090 --> 05:36.750
There's a legendary drink out
there called Fake Denki Bran.

05:36.750 --> 05:37.580
"Fake"?

05:37.860 --> 05:42.020
Denki Bran was cooked up by a well-known
joint in Asakusa back in the 1800s...

05:42.020 --> 05:43.840
It's a cocktail gone down in history.

05:43.840 --> 05:47.810
It's so famous you can find
the stuff in convenience stores,

05:47.810 --> 05:51.350
but the recipe was kept
under lock-and-key for ages.

05:51.810 --> 05:53.460
However, some time ago,

05:53.460 --> 05:55.980
some guy working for
Kyoto Central Telephone

05:55.980 --> 05:58.900
got the bright idea to
try replicating its flavor.

05:59.110 --> 06:01.910
After traveling down blind
alleys of trial-and-error,

06:01.910 --> 06:04.220
what he discovered at
the end of his journey,

06:04.220 --> 06:06.420
that's what's now known
as Fake Denki Bran.

06:11.220 --> 06:12.940
Both its taste and its scent,

06:12.940 --> 06:15.440
they're totally different from Denki Bran,

06:15.440 --> 06:18.270
but the mysterious and
enticing flavor it DOES have,

06:18.270 --> 06:20.890
you can tell it's still being
made in secret somewhere,

06:20.890 --> 06:23.420
and being smuggled through
the streets as we speak.

06:23.420 --> 06:25.380
I'd really like to give it a try...

06:26.400 --> 06:28.660
You're a girl after my own heart!

06:30.390 --> 06:31.340
Hey, you!

06:31.340 --> 06:33.520
We've got some good girls if you're lost!

06:35.030 --> 06:36.330
I'm fine.

06:36.330 --> 06:39.660
- A raven-haired maiden is my goal!
- So, raven hair is what you're after...

06:39.660 --> 06:42.580
- That's not what I meant!
- Don't take this personally.

06:46.430 --> 06:49.910
Looking at you brings back
memories of my daughter.

06:49.910 --> 06:52.440
I was never the greatest father to her...

06:52.440 --> 06:54.350
Been a while since we met face-to-face.

06:54.350 --> 06:56.510
Not like I got the right to see her anyway...

06:56.510 --> 06:58.910
This is one of the most
important days of her life...

06:58.910 --> 07:00.910
And I stood her up...

07:03.770 --> 07:05.140
Young lady!!!

07:05.140 --> 07:08.430
Never forget to grab onto
happiness with your own hands!

07:08.430 --> 07:10.820
Find out what's valuable and hold tight!

07:10.820 --> 07:11.420
Yes!

07:12.010 --> 07:13.580
Go and give it your all!

07:13.580 --> 07:14.160
Yes!

07:15.820 --> 07:17.950
- Give it your all...
- Yes!

07:19.650 --> 07:21.930
G-Give it your all...!

07:21.930 --> 07:23.100
Todo-san...

07:23.100 --> 07:24.870
Give it your all --

07:29.570 --> 07:31.310
Well, you sure showed him!

07:33.350 --> 07:36.330
Oh? Well, this is rather shameless.

07:36.330 --> 07:38.310
Th-This is erotic art!

07:38.310 --> 07:40.300
I'm an art collector, damn it!

07:40.300 --> 07:43.020
Todo's well-known for
being a gross old pervert...

07:43.020 --> 07:45.290
He's just a piece of shit
from top to bottom.

07:45.290 --> 07:47.720
A grope here or there
ain't gonna hurt anything!

07:49.060 --> 07:54.020
You shouldn't so easily put your faith
in people you chance by out at night.

07:54.020 --> 07:56.300
Of course, I'm referring to US as well.

07:59.730 --> 08:03.080
He's part of some gross group called
the Bedchamber Investigation Team,

08:03.080 --> 08:05.290
all he does is collect
that perverted stuff!

08:05.290 --> 08:07.670
I hear his business has plunged these days,

08:07.670 --> 08:10.330
and he's plunged himself
into debt as a result...

08:10.850 --> 08:14.320
Well, it's not for me to know how
the vulgar masses live their lives.

08:16.540 --> 08:19.530
But I didn't know that then,
and I still did something awful.

08:19.530 --> 08:20.890
It's fine, it's fine!

08:20.890 --> 08:22.960
BE more awful and cold-hearted!

08:22.960 --> 08:25.300
But y'know, you sure have
one hell of a punch...

08:25.300 --> 08:27.330
That's what I call my Friendship Punch.

08:27.330 --> 08:29.830
My mother taught it to
me when I was little.

08:29.830 --> 08:31.250
Do you understand?

08:31.250 --> 08:33.260
As you make your way through this world,

08:33.260 --> 08:35.340
you will find the noble amount to a handful.

08:35.360 --> 08:37.450
What's left are utter fools and rotten fiends,

08:37.450 --> 08:39.920
or quite possibly utterly foolish rotten fiends.

08:39.920 --> 08:42.930
Such encounters are when you
must use the Friendship Punch.

08:43.330 --> 08:46.360
When you wrap your thumb
in your four fingers like so,

08:46.360 --> 08:49.360
your fist becomes like the
warm paw of the Beckoning Cat...

08:49.360 --> 08:52.130
Such a fist can no longer truly
convey feelings of hatred.

08:52.130 --> 08:55.010
Thus, we are freed from the chains of violence,

08:55.010 --> 08:57.860
and thus we invite harmony into this world.

08:59.350 --> 09:00.660
This is my trump card,

09:00.660 --> 09:05.850
the only technique my parents permit
me to use on the outside world.

09:06.300 --> 09:08.870
You certainly seem wise beyond your years!

09:08.870 --> 09:11.050
Perhaps you'd like to join us tonight?

09:11.050 --> 09:13.470
We'll show you how things
are done in Pontocho!

09:13.470 --> 09:14.710
I would love that!

09:14.710 --> 09:16.360
But, I don't have any more money...

09:16.360 --> 09:17.510
No need to worry.

09:17.510 --> 09:20.210
It's been many years since
I'VE had money either.

09:20.210 --> 09:22.040
Put it on Todo's tab, okay?

09:23.380 --> 09:25.740
Money is indeed quite nomadic.

09:25.970 --> 09:29.480
If you mark some, it's not unheard of
to come across it again in your life.

09:29.920 --> 09:32.920
Looks like Rihaku-san
is up to his old tricks...

09:33.140 --> 09:35.430
You've heard of him,
the crazy old loan shark?

09:35.430 --> 09:38.450
The one who goes around in
that luxurious 3-story tall train!

09:38.450 --> 09:40.900
He's a big collector of
old books and antiques...

09:40.900 --> 09:44.220
And apparently, the underwear
stolen off young men!

09:44.420 --> 09:47.740
Ew, Higuchi! Wearing used
pants like that is totally gross!

09:47.740 --> 09:51.640
He also has quite the collection
of a drink called Fake Denki Bran.

09:51.640 --> 09:52.930
The one from the legend...?

09:54.840 --> 09:56.150
But this worked out well.

09:56.400 --> 09:58.510
Higuchi-kun doesn't wear any underwear!

10:04.550 --> 10:05.970
Excuse me, would anyone...?

10:06.440 --> 10:08.970
Would anyone happen to have underwear?

10:09.610 --> 10:10.790
Damn it...

10:10.790 --> 10:12.320
Why's this gotta happen to me...

10:12.320 --> 10:13.490
Hey, young'n!

10:13.670 --> 10:15.260
You lookin' for some help?

10:15.260 --> 10:15.950
Yes!!!

10:15.950 --> 10:17.470
Some underwear, please!!!

10:17.990 --> 10:20.650
Then get up here and help
me drown my sorrows!

10:20.650 --> 10:22.480
We're gonna get plastered...

10:32.770 --> 10:35.500
Now take a good look and
see how she does things.

10:38.330 --> 10:39.880
Yay!!!

10:40.490 --> 10:41.640
Who are you?!

10:41.640 --> 10:43.530
Who cares, are you out for a drink?

10:43.820 --> 10:45.760
- Yay!
- I-I am...

10:45.760 --> 10:47.080
Sounds like fun!

10:47.080 --> 10:50.100
Let's go down all of
the booze in Kiyamachi!

10:50.100 --> 10:51.360
Yay!

10:51.840 --> 10:53.500
- Yaaaay!!!
- Let's go!

10:53.510 --> 10:55.970
We've breached the walls, and we mustn't hesitate.

10:56.650 --> 10:58.610
Shame will only give you away here.

10:58.610 --> 11:03.500
Waltzing in uninvited is a test of one's will --
Will you sink, or will you swim?

10:59.690 --> 11:04.970
Rhetoric Club

11:03.500 --> 11:06.440
So you just want to be
a spectator, my dear?

11:07.240 --> 11:08.860
Why are you...
Licking my ear?!

11:08.860 --> 11:10.740
If you don't have talent, then work hard!

11:11.560 --> 11:13.750
Working hard REQUIRES talent!

11:13.750 --> 11:14.770
And therefore...

11:14.770 --> 11:16.770
Enough of this! You don't know anything!

11:17.190 --> 11:19.370
Just WHAT is going on here?

11:19.370 --> 11:21.420
The chaos from arguing for argument's sake.

11:21.420 --> 11:22.790
That's not it at all!

11:22.790 --> 11:23.910
It's called rhetoric!

11:23.910 --> 11:25.210
Oh, and you...

11:25.210 --> 11:29.720
Which is better, marrying the man
you love or the one you don't?

11:31.810 --> 11:34.440
The man you DON'T love is a far better choice!

11:34.440 --> 11:37.720
Once love enters the picture,
one loses all sense of reason.

11:37.720 --> 11:41.090
Choosing the man you don't love
is a choice made from pure logic!

11:41.320 --> 11:43.210
This is a life-long decision, after all,

11:43.210 --> 11:47.280
so it needs to be a rational decision
born strictly from prudence!

11:47.280 --> 11:48.910
These so-called feelings of love,

11:48.910 --> 11:51.170
they can't be explained with any rationality!

11:51.170 --> 11:53.740
They shouldn't be part of
marriage in the first place!

11:54.520 --> 11:58.250
Feelings of love will never cool for one
you never felt love for in the first place!

11:58.250 --> 12:01.180
Infidelity won't burden
you with shame and jealousy!

12:01.550 --> 12:06.760
Rationality practically demands that women
should marry men they don't love...

12:06.760 --> 12:10.760
- So why DO they marry for love...
- We're at this guy's farewell party!

12:10.760 --> 12:12.770
He got jilted and he's off to study in London!

12:12.770 --> 12:14.670
Damn it!!!

12:14.670 --> 12:16.740
Who the hell wants to go to England?!

12:16.740 --> 12:19.650
Naoko-san...!!!

12:19.650 --> 12:20.260
Now then!

12:20.260 --> 12:23.830
Let us celebrate the future prospects
of our senpai Kousaka in London!

12:23.830 --> 12:25.620
The Dance of the Sophists, begin!!!

12:25.830 --> 12:28.550
Senpai! Go off and become a great man!

12:28.820 --> 12:32.180
Become a great man, forget your
problems, and never come back here!

12:32.180 --> 12:34.440
Don't worry, Senpai, we'll be fine without you!

12:38.080 --> 12:39.120
Thank you!!!

12:39.120 --> 12:42.750
It's an immense joy being sent
off by gentlemen like you!

12:42.750 --> 12:44.560
Shall we head off to Pontocho now?

12:50.630 --> 12:53.660
- Well, hello!
- My, it HAS been a while!

12:53.660 --> 12:55.320
This is a 60th birthday celebration.

12:55.320 --> 12:57.690
That's wonderful! You wanna drink?

12:57.690 --> 13:01.520
- My son's wedding was today.
- Even better, let's drink!

13:01.520 --> 13:03.140
Life is over much too soon...

13:03.140 --> 13:04.490
What is life, anyway.

13:04.490 --> 13:06.490
It's literally one's lifespan, is it not?

13:06.490 --> 13:09.130
- So at the end of life is death?
- No, the opposite!

13:09.130 --> 13:10.800
So what do we call the end of life?

13:10.800 --> 13:13.840
Let's treat life and one's
lifespan as different, shall we?

13:14.530 --> 13:16.190
Well this is a drag.

13:16.420 --> 13:19.210
No one's touching any of the
Akadama Punch I brought...

13:19.900 --> 13:21.540
Higuchi-kun, you know some tricks!

13:21.540 --> 13:23.220
Come on, liven up this party!

13:23.220 --> 13:25.720
Well, the tension in the room is a tad thick,

13:25.720 --> 13:28.190
but I'll try my Higuchi-Style Flying Technique.

13:35.970 --> 13:37.960
- Boring...
- Why's he wearing pants?

13:39.610 --> 13:41.240
My spectators...

13:41.740 --> 13:43.240
...Are worse off than I thought.

13:44.930 --> 13:46.740
I wish it was more lively in here...

13:46.740 --> 13:48.740
Us oldsters are running out of time!

13:48.740 --> 13:50.660
The hours are only getting faster...

13:50.660 --> 13:53.240
Young lady, you mind if I see your watch?

13:53.680 --> 13:55.240
- Oh, my!
- It's so slow!

13:55.260 --> 13:56.240
Isn't this normal?

13:56.240 --> 13:57.960
This is what ours look like.

13:57.960 --> 13:59.490
DAYS

13:59.490 --> 14:01.680
And see how that compares to ours!

14:01.250 --> 14:04.250
YEARS

14:04.250 --> 14:05.990
Time certainly does fly...

14:08.350 --> 14:10.020
You're keeping a good pace!

14:10.020 --> 14:10.790
Huh?!

14:12.780 --> 14:15.020
You, you polished off
all of these, didn't you!

14:15.520 --> 14:16.960
You can sure hold your stuff!

14:17.190 --> 14:19.310
I drink until there's nothing left!

14:20.500 --> 14:21.700
She's the real deal...

14:23.320 --> 14:27.500
I may be plain, unpolished,
and less interesting than a rice cooker,

14:27.500 --> 14:30.070
But here and now, I demand
you all point and laugh!

14:34.870 --> 14:36.850
C'mon, what the heck are you doing?

14:36.850 --> 14:38.860
That's... That's the Dance of the Sophists!

14:39.080 --> 14:41.840
The Dance of the Sophists
we dreamed up so long ago!

14:41.840 --> 14:44.150
Okay, everyone, join in!

14:44.150 --> 14:48.310
This! This is from those lazy days
we spent dabbling in rhetoric!

14:48.310 --> 14:50.020
This takes me back!

14:50.020 --> 14:51.440
Us! Exactly like eels!

14:51.440 --> 14:54.090
Slippery and slimy, no one could pin us down!

14:55.210 --> 14:58.160
It appears that she's this
evening's leading lady.

14:58.390 --> 15:01.480
To think that such a
tradition would live on today!

15:01.480 --> 15:04.050
The cherished desire of any
alumni of the Rhetoric Club!

15:04.050 --> 15:07.990
Well, let's keep it going, this Dance
of Burdens to the Next Generation!

15:08.900 --> 15:10.500
Now, drink up!

15:10.500 --> 15:13.360
A talent like yours only comes every 100 years!

15:13.360 --> 15:15.730
You should match your skills against Rihaku!

15:15.730 --> 15:17.500
With him? Yes, she could!

15:17.500 --> 15:20.800
If you win against him,
he'll grant any wish you ask!

15:20.800 --> 15:23.510
You could drink Fake Denki Bran
to your heart's content...

15:23.660 --> 15:25.210
If he wants a fight, I'll give it.

15:25.910 --> 15:27.920
I'd bet on you to win for sure!

15:27.920 --> 15:30.300
- Me, too!
- And me as well!

15:31.800 --> 15:35.200
C'mon, ain't you gonna drink with me?!

15:35.570 --> 15:37.680
Chug! Chug!

15:37.680 --> 15:40.190
Uh, I don't know about
being forced to chug...

15:40.190 --> 15:41.650
Who gives a shit!?

15:41.650 --> 15:43.980
I'm gonna be forcin' you, anyway!

15:44.380 --> 15:47.410
Back in the '80s bubble,
I was rollin' in dough...

15:48.010 --> 15:50.400
Now, that's just a far-off dream...

15:50.400 --> 15:52.610
The final blow was that
tornado the other day...

15:53.280 --> 15:55.410
Whirling down from Fushimi Castle,

15:55.410 --> 15:58.110
it came roaring towards
my koi carp nursery!

15:58.110 --> 16:02.380
All of my beloved koi were sucked up,
sent swirling into the night sky!

16:03.020 --> 16:04.290
Yuko!!!

16:04.290 --> 16:05.480
Jirokichi!!!

16:05.480 --> 16:07.630
Damn you!!!

16:07.930 --> 16:09.560
Gimme back Yuko!

16:09.560 --> 16:12.180
Gimme back Jirokichi!!!

16:12.610 --> 16:13.680
Um, excuse me...

16:13.680 --> 16:15.900
Could I get that underwear now...?

16:15.900 --> 16:19.430
You think a scum-sucking student
like you DESERVES underwear?!

16:19.720 --> 16:23.430
I got to where I was by bustin' my ass
through my own naked merits...

16:23.970 --> 16:25.570
Damn it!!!

16:28.410 --> 16:29.400
Todo-san!

16:30.400 --> 16:32.760
Is it true you're giving
away your collection?

16:33.520 --> 16:34.980
Go away!!!

16:34.980 --> 16:37.020
I got it rough, y'know?!

16:37.610 --> 16:38.820
May I have a look?

16:40.860 --> 16:43.820
And these are such
splendid ones, too...

16:44.700 --> 16:45.720
Hey, young man!

16:45.720 --> 16:48.130
You're lookin' like you
wanna call me a creep!

16:48.130 --> 16:49.430
I'm not saying anything!

16:49.430 --> 16:51.800
We're the Bedchamber Investigation Team,

16:51.800 --> 16:55.230
we only seek to gather artifacts
of our sensual cultural heritage!

16:55.800 --> 16:58.210
"What ya really mean
is you collect porn!"

16:58.480 --> 17:00.230
That's what you wanna say, right?!

17:00.230 --> 17:01.690
I'm not saying anything!!!

17:01.690 --> 17:04.240
That asshole's comin' after my collection...

17:04.240 --> 17:07.700
He offered me that sweet loan,
which tore my daughter away from me...

17:07.700 --> 17:11.930
And now he's tearin' away my
erotic art, the only friend I got left!

17:12.540 --> 17:14.220
When will Rihaku-san get here?

17:14.630 --> 17:17.480
He's gonna be here any minute now...

17:17.480 --> 17:18.170
All right!

17:18.170 --> 17:20.220
I'll go contact everyone in Bedchamber!

17:20.220 --> 17:23.340
We'll all come send these ladies
off with one final viewing!

17:23.340 --> 17:25.110
Thank you!!!

17:25.110 --> 17:27.310
Thank you...

17:27.310 --> 17:28.750
You're comin' too!

17:35.780 --> 17:36.780
Over here!

17:37.070 --> 17:37.740
Okay!

17:44.410 --> 17:46.400
Rihaku, come out and play...

17:46.400 --> 17:48.500
Rihaku, come out and play!

17:59.260 --> 18:01.310
Rihaku, come out and play!

18:06.080 --> 18:08.580
Rihaku, come out and play!

18:11.960 --> 18:13.760
No, you're doing it all wrong!!!

18:13.760 --> 18:15.330
Leave ALL your shame behind!

18:15.330 --> 18:16.090
Yo!!!

18:16.090 --> 18:18.700
Rihaku, come out and play!

18:19.210 --> 18:20.440
What's this?!

18:20.440 --> 18:21.630
Would you look at that!

18:21.910 --> 18:23.090
It just sort of happened!

18:23.090 --> 18:24.490
Naoko-san!!!

18:24.490 --> 18:25.850
Yasuo!!!

18:34.600 --> 18:35.920
Such a tragic loss!

18:35.920 --> 18:38.860
This is a hard reset on
cultural anthropology!

18:38.860 --> 18:43.100
"Why are grown men cryin'
their asses off over erotic art!!!"

18:43.100 --> 18:45.110
That's the kinda look
you got in your eyes!

18:45.110 --> 18:48.120
For the last time, I don't care!
You self-conscious or something?

18:49.910 --> 18:52.970
It sounds like some hero is
challenging Rihaku to a drink off.

18:52.970 --> 18:54.890
What, they got no self-preservation?

18:54.890 --> 18:58.890
Yeah, they're runnin' around
Kiyamachi tearin' the place apart!

18:59.260 --> 19:01.530
I heard they're 6 meters tall!

19:01.750 --> 19:04.160
A giant wearing a ragged old yukata!

19:04.160 --> 19:06.230
I hear they can shoot koi out of their mouth!

19:07.300 --> 19:09.930
They came here all the
way from far-off Oshu!

19:09.930 --> 19:11.920
Less a hero, more a monster!

19:11.920 --> 19:12.940
A sleeping giant!

19:12.940 --> 19:13.960
A fallen monk!

19:19.500 --> 19:20.840
Who on earth are YOU people?!

19:21.000 --> 19:24.070
Just those who wield rhetoric
to become slippery like eels!

19:24.070 --> 19:25.620
My love is happy.

19:25.620 --> 19:27.940
And knowing that, I am happy too!

19:27.940 --> 19:29.030
Banzai!

19:29.030 --> 19:30.090
Banzai...

19:33.640 --> 19:34.920
What's going on up there?

19:35.270 --> 19:38.020
No, I'm ruined!!!

19:38.020 --> 19:39.910
Todo-san! Don't give in to despair!

19:39.910 --> 19:40.940
It doesn't matter!

19:40.940 --> 19:43.480
That ol' bastard's gonna kill me for sure!

19:43.480 --> 19:44.590
How picturesque!

19:44.590 --> 19:45.760
Dad?!

19:45.760 --> 19:46.990
Naoko!!!

19:47.650 --> 19:50.480
- I'm gonna die of shame here!!!
- Knock it off already, Dad!

19:50.480 --> 19:52.670
I don't care if you're a big perv!

19:52.670 --> 19:54.260
Naoko-san!!!

19:54.260 --> 19:55.260
Kousaka-kun...?!

19:55.260 --> 19:56.180
I'm begging you!

19:56.180 --> 19:57.810
Please, marry me instead!

19:57.810 --> 19:59.510
If you truly love that man,

19:59.510 --> 20:01.900
I'm begging you to not marry him!

20:01.900 --> 20:03.340
Yes, you've been over this...

20:03.650 --> 20:05.330
No idea what your point is, though...

20:05.330 --> 20:07.350
Kousaka, you're an
embarrassment to men!

20:07.350 --> 20:09.180
Why are you still in Japan?

20:14.670 --> 20:16.200
At last, he takes the stage.

20:23.710 --> 20:25.310
Rihaku

20:28.990 --> 20:31.470
Todo-san. It's been a while.

20:31.690 --> 20:33.230
Where are the goods?

20:33.230 --> 20:36.180
That punk kid there ruined them!!!

20:36.630 --> 20:38.710
- Man, that's gross...
- Totally...

20:39.450 --> 20:41.720
So you haven't kept your word.

20:41.970 --> 20:44.940
How do you plan on settling your debts now?

20:45.230 --> 20:46.980
He's gonna kill me!!!

20:46.980 --> 20:48.530
Why don't you come on board.

20:50.280 --> 20:51.300
Wait right there!

20:54.440 --> 20:55.750
Huh?! It's you...!

20:55.900 --> 20:58.290
Todo-san! You mustn't give up!

20:58.750 --> 21:00.600
There's always another
move on the board!

21:00.870 --> 21:02.400
You?! But why...

21:02.700 --> 21:06.710
I'm the guy who threw around
erotic art and felt you up!

21:07.170 --> 21:08.030
However...

21:08.030 --> 21:10.750
You still introduced me to
a wonderful way to view life.

21:11.220 --> 21:12.060
Rihaku-san!

21:12.330 --> 21:13.940
I shall be your opponent tonight...

21:13.940 --> 21:16.090
I challenge you to a drinking contest!

21:16.770 --> 21:18.760
And I will most certainly be the victor.

21:19.170 --> 21:20.670
Quite the development...

21:24.340 --> 21:25.770
...As you wish.

21:45.500 --> 21:46.780
My underwear...!!!

21:47.660 --> 21:49.320
This floor is the bathhouse,

21:49.320 --> 21:50.970
the banquet hall is below.

22:09.850 --> 22:11.580
Fake Denki Bran.

22:12.110 --> 22:15.570
Alcohol as transparent as pure water.

22:16.200 --> 22:18.740
If I prove victorious, his debt is doubled.

22:19.810 --> 22:21.750
You know there's no mercy?

22:28.620 --> 22:31.520
If you so allow me, I shall act as judge.

22:32.330 --> 22:35.050
Now then, begin!!!

22:50.710 --> 22:54.040
The taste of Fake Denki Bran
is life's meaninglessness.

23:00.000 --> 23:04.020
To me, the taste is like being filled
from top to bottom with life's warmth...

23:04.020 --> 23:05.380
Luxurious and abundant.

23:09.040 --> 23:12.060
You're a brat who knows nothing of life.

23:12.060 --> 23:13.460
Life is empty...

23:16.000 --> 23:17.070
Plentiful.

23:24.490 --> 23:26.090
Truly empty...

23:29.520 --> 23:31.730
Life is isolation and hollowness,

23:31.730 --> 23:33.240
gone in an instant.

23:35.010 --> 23:36.860
Life is nothing but taking.

23:36.860 --> 23:37.870
Giving.

23:37.870 --> 23:38.880
Anguish.

23:38.880 --> 23:39.870
Joy.

23:42.680 --> 23:44.630
So why are you out tonight?

23:44.960 --> 23:47.370
I'm only following my thread of fate.

23:48.520 --> 23:51.380
I believe everything,
even drinking with you,

23:51.380 --> 23:54.830
all of it is connected somehow.

23:54.940 --> 23:56.570
You'll soon understand.

23:56.670 --> 23:58.640
That's only the deception of the drink.

23:58.850 --> 24:02.250
Reality is a bleak world full of
nothing but lust and greed.

24:02.640 --> 24:04.850
There are no connections between people.

24:04.850 --> 24:06.040
Only isolation...

24:11.630 --> 24:13.590
I...

24:14.510 --> 24:15.600
Can't...

24:15.950 --> 24:17.370
Go on...

24:19.480 --> 24:21.530
Victory goes to the young lady!

24:25.200 --> 24:26.380
Thank you!!!

24:26.380 --> 24:28.010
Thank you so much!

24:28.010 --> 24:31.020
You, your stomach bottomless?!

24:31.640 --> 24:33.800
Yahoo!!!

24:39.390 --> 24:40.390
Don't mind me...

25:17.220 --> 25:18.380
Upon first glance,

25:18.380 --> 25:21.570
there were only couples sitting
alongside the Kamo River.

25:22.420 --> 25:25.840
They're so evenly spaced,
is there some rule in place here?

25:30.420 --> 25:31.800
So chilly...

25:31.800 --> 25:34.590
Don't talk nonsense,
you don't find it humid?

25:35.770 --> 25:36.930
Thank you...

25:39.210 --> 25:40.190
What do we have here?

25:40.190 --> 25:42.660
A flyer for the Evening Used Book Market.

25:42.660 --> 25:44.100
That's still going on?

25:49.550 --> 25:52.890
Suddenly, I was being pulled through
time by all the books I'd read,

25:52.890 --> 25:55.860
and I was drawn back to my old
picture book, Ra Ta Ta Tam.

25:56.140 --> 25:57.980
A story about a small white train,

25:57.980 --> 26:01.870
I would ride its rails to go on adventures
outside the bounds of my cramped room.

26:02.900 --> 26:06.330
How did I ever manage to lose a
book as wonderful as that one?

26:07.340 --> 26:10.870
I set out to lay eyes on it once again!

26:17.760 --> 26:18.710
You're awake?

26:20.180 --> 26:22.140
This is the School Festival Executive Office.

26:22.390 --> 26:24.530
This used to be HQ for the Library Police,

26:24.530 --> 26:28.980
an organization made to collect
overdue library books from students.

26:29.480 --> 26:32.270
Furnished with the latest
in surveillance equipment,

26:32.270 --> 26:35.750
every single piece of information
on our students is gathered here.

26:36.800 --> 26:39.870
The work of the School Festival
Executive is indeed taxing --

26:39.870 --> 26:44.600
To ensure our merry fools of students
make a soft landing with harsh reality,

26:44.600 --> 26:47.750
we keep firm grip on every detail
of their desires and actions,

26:47.750 --> 26:49.720
anticipating every one of their next moves.

26:50.270 --> 26:52.060
So why I am here...?

26:54.860 --> 26:55.660
You don't mean!

26:56.990 --> 26:57.910
You've...

26:58.350 --> 26:59.150
That's right.

26:59.660 --> 27:02.740
Naturally, we've collected info on her as well.

27:03.150 --> 27:04.650
- Profile
- Books Borrowed

27:04.650 --> 27:06.140
- Convenience Store Purchases
- Video Rentals

27:06.170 --> 27:07.640
- Diary
- Letters Sent

27:07.770 --> 27:08.400
This...

27:09.160 --> 27:10.050
This is...!!!

27:10.980 --> 27:12.850
This is illegal, isn't it!!!

27:13.880 --> 27:15.860
So you DON'T want to know?

27:26.260 --> 27:27.900
I suppose you'd call this an exchange,

27:27.900 --> 27:31.880
but I was hoping you would help
me out of friendship regardless.

27:32.280 --> 27:34.380
There are just so many troublemakers,

27:34.380 --> 27:36.630
and I'm anxious about our
capability to crack down.

27:36.950 --> 27:39.650
The girl is a fan of a book
named Ra Ta Ta Tam --

27:39.650 --> 27:41.150
Ever since reading it as a girl,

27:41.150 --> 27:43.110
the book has acted as her guiding light,

27:43.110 --> 27:45.000
and it seems she's suddenly remembered it.

27:47.220 --> 27:47.560
RA

27:47.680 --> 27:48.080
TA

27:48.140 --> 27:48.430
TA

27:48.540 --> 27:48.970
TA

27:49.060 --> 27:49.640
M

27:49.860 --> 27:52.150
Where can I get my
hands on that book?

27:52.540 --> 27:54.830
There are many options
for both old and new copies,

27:54.830 --> 27:58.910
from online auctions to bookstores
of several shapes and sizes...

27:59.350 --> 28:01.590
However, the exact copy she had as a child

28:01.590 --> 28:04.430
has just reappeared on
the market as a used book.

28:05.040 --> 28:06.230
Th-That's...

28:06.530 --> 28:07.280
Here.

28:07.450 --> 28:10.610
It's expected to appear at the
Shimogamo Evening Used Book Market.

28:11.420 --> 28:14.810
If you were to obtain this, it would
be quite easy to claim her heart!

28:19.950 --> 28:21.600
Used Book Festival

28:21.630 --> 28:23.770
This was exactly like a sea of books!

28:23.770 --> 28:25.430
I was a fish in the deepest depths,

28:25.430 --> 28:27.910
migrating this way and
that in search of prey!

28:39.590 --> 28:42.580
Birds, Beasts, and Relatives
By: Gerald Durrell

28:45.080 --> 28:47.830
Viva, beginner's luck!

28:49.980 --> 28:53.020
Why is it still so damn
hot this time of night?!

28:53.270 --> 28:55.040
I can't stand used books.

28:55.360 --> 28:58.940
Used books call out in deceit,
"Read us and obtain knowledge!"

28:58.940 --> 29:01.860
but never once have I put any of
that knowledge to practical use.

29:02.300 --> 29:04.880
What I need now isn't knowledge,
but grace and charm!

29:05.110 --> 29:07.330
THEN perhaps we can
talk about knowledge --

29:12.130 --> 29:14.460
What did you do?!
I demand reparations!!!

29:14.460 --> 29:16.480
That's what I'm entitled to say here!

29:16.480 --> 29:19.140
You don't see you're the one
who needs to apologize?

29:19.140 --> 29:21.790
Hmmph, you've got your
mind focused on that girl, huh?

29:21.790 --> 29:22.420
What?!

29:22.420 --> 29:24.840
"If I get my hands on her beloved book,"

29:24.840 --> 29:26.680
"it'll be a cinch to claim her heart."

29:26.680 --> 29:28.870
At least, that's what
you're thinking, right...?

29:28.870 --> 29:30.390
Th-That's TOO on the nose!

29:34.720 --> 29:37.610
If one suddenly finds the book
they've spent years searching for,

29:37.610 --> 29:40.380
or when one remembers
a book from their past

29:40.380 --> 29:42.680
and it appears out of
nowhere in front of them,

29:42.680 --> 29:45.820
I can feel the pull of the thread of fate.

29:47.000 --> 29:49.530
Almost like there is a
God of the Used Book Market,

29:49.530 --> 29:53.300
one who can fashion a happy
encounter with the book I desire,

29:53.530 --> 29:57.530
one who can bring me back to
forgotten books from my past...

29:57.530 --> 29:59.330
At least, that was my gut feeling.

30:00.830 --> 30:03.320
But Ra Ta Ta Tam was
nowhere to be found.

30:03.600 --> 30:07.440
I suppose even the God of the Used Book
Market needs a day off sometimes.

30:07.440 --> 30:09.030
I'm feelin' the same as you...

30:09.030 --> 30:11.020
I'm not findin' the books I really want.

30:11.020 --> 30:15.290
Some nasty collector's got
a tight grip on the rare stuff.

30:15.290 --> 30:16.380
You heard me?

30:16.380 --> 30:19.880
Y'know, way back when,
books traveled from person to person!

30:19.880 --> 30:21.840
A book is reborn
each time it's passed on,

30:21.840 --> 30:23.600
it's one of the things
that ties us together.

30:23.600 --> 30:27.600
But it's like that damn collector's put
up a dam to stop the flow of books.

30:26.440 --> 30:27.060
DAM

30:27.580 --> 30:28.350
DAM

30:28.390 --> 30:31.500
Holdin' shadowy auctions
for all his rare books...

30:31.500 --> 30:34.450
Only fools who don't
value their lives take part.

30:34.450 --> 30:35.730
Quite the terrible thing...

30:35.950 --> 30:37.900
Ah! Wait! You stupid brat!

30:38.090 --> 30:39.930
You yanked off the price tags! Stop!

30:39.930 --> 30:41.900
Stop, I said, STOP!!!

30:41.900 --> 30:43.680
Stop, c'mon stop, I said!

30:46.740 --> 30:48.360
Damn that stupid kid...

30:48.560 --> 30:50.720
Getting ice cream all over my pants...

30:51.600 --> 30:54.130
But at least that's all over with now...

30:54.970 --> 30:57.160
Hey kid, give it up already!!!

30:57.170 --> 30:58.150
Huh?! The heck?

30:58.540 --> 31:00.440
What the hell is this?!

31:03.000 --> 31:06.030
This guy's the one
who made me do it!!!

31:06.030 --> 31:09.680
If I didn't, he said he
was gonna molest me!!!

31:09.680 --> 31:10.780
So I...

31:11.420 --> 31:12.400
Hey you.

31:12.400 --> 31:14.230
Why don't you come with me.

31:14.740 --> 31:16.450
H-Hold on! Wait!

31:16.450 --> 31:17.440
I didn't do...

31:21.300 --> 31:23.290
He was going to molest that child...

31:23.290 --> 31:24.770
Hope you like prison, kid.

31:24.770 --> 31:25.940
I'm sure I won't!!!

31:25.940 --> 31:26.540
Hey!

31:26.750 --> 31:27.920
Where'd that brat go?!

31:27.920 --> 31:29.370
What's goin' on here, kid?

31:29.620 --> 31:32.610
Dealin' with another
pants problem, huh?

31:37.320 --> 31:38.350
Yo!

31:41.540 --> 31:42.720
You wanna drink?

31:45.540 --> 31:47.790
An ice kotatsu, how refined!

31:48.300 --> 31:51.220
Higuchi-san, did you really
read all of these books?

31:51.220 --> 31:52.330
Heaven forbid!

31:52.650 --> 31:56.180
I'm selling these to acquaintances
of mine for quite the mark-up.

31:56.720 --> 31:58.760
I must express my gratitude for books.

31:58.760 --> 32:03.830
To think people would pay so handsomely
for nothing more than paper stained with ink.

32:04.070 --> 32:07.600
Anyone who collects dirty things
like those is a total moron!

32:11.260 --> 32:13.760
Today I had quite the harvest.

32:13.760 --> 32:16.760
If you're interested, I'll treat
you to some yakisoba as well.

32:16.940 --> 32:18.100
Thank you so much!

32:18.360 --> 32:20.090
Higuchi treating someone?

32:20.090 --> 32:22.180
That's once every 25 years!

32:26.100 --> 32:28.410
My, it appears even more
profit is on the table.

32:28.410 --> 32:31.700
I have another matter to attend to,
please wait here for my return.

32:31.700 --> 32:32.460
Sure!

32:32.460 --> 32:34.360
This guy here's Don Underwear.

32:34.360 --> 32:36.710
He's quite the hardcore romanticist!

32:37.320 --> 32:39.170
I am no romanticist.

32:39.170 --> 32:39.900
Just...

32:39.900 --> 32:43.530
Someone toiling to once
again meet their fated love.

32:43.530 --> 32:44.300
See what I mean?

32:44.770 --> 32:47.150
It sounds like there's a story there!

32:48.320 --> 32:50.160
It was during last year's School Festival...

32:50.410 --> 32:53.210
After watching a
friend's trifle of a play,

32:53.700 --> 32:55.420
I took seat on a bench...

32:58.360 --> 33:00.950
A rain of apples began
to fall from the sky.

33:00.950 --> 33:01.770
Apples?

33:02.000 --> 33:05.610
Most likely, some students were
transporting them to make apple candy,

33:05.610 --> 33:08.500
and they spilled simultaneously
on the floors above.

33:09.510 --> 33:11.360
And so, down below,
at the same time,

33:11.360 --> 33:13.320
apples bounced off both our heads.

33:20.920 --> 33:23.590
At that moment, it was like my
heart was shot from my chest!

33:24.210 --> 33:25.740
There was no doubt it was love!

33:26.090 --> 33:27.950
Surely, this must have been fate.

33:30.580 --> 33:31.430
However...

33:31.430 --> 33:33.840
I had no idea about
what I should do next.

33:34.500 --> 33:37.650
Our connection was only based
on simultaneous apple thumps,

33:37.650 --> 33:39.880
and so I hesitated
in calling out to her.

33:41.670 --> 33:43.080
And ever since she left...

33:44.610 --> 33:47.410
Not a day has gone by where
I haven't thought of her.

33:49.130 --> 33:51.100
If only I could see her once again,

33:51.100 --> 33:53.220
I would not give in to hesitation!

33:53.970 --> 33:56.890
However, I had no idea on
how to search for her.

33:56.890 --> 33:59.720
I could not trust gossip and
hearsay enough to rely on it.

33:59.980 --> 34:02.040
Everything was chance arranged by fate,

34:02.040 --> 34:04.420
the entire incident had
the flair of the romantic!

34:04.420 --> 34:06.640
I told he was a romantic...

34:06.640 --> 34:10.260
And thus, I went to Yoshida
Shrine and I made my vow.

34:10.260 --> 34:12.480
Until the day I laid eyes on her again...

34:12.480 --> 34:15.450
Until then, I would never
remove this pair of underwear!

34:15.450 --> 34:16.260
Wow!

34:16.260 --> 34:19.240
I think you got some wires
crossed in that head of yours...

34:26.460 --> 34:27.650
Thank you so much!

34:28.000 --> 34:29.690
Thanks ain't necessary.

34:29.950 --> 34:31.520
I got connections.

34:31.970 --> 34:33.040
Well then, I'll...

34:33.040 --> 34:35.930
The ol' koi nursery's
starting to rally again,

34:35.930 --> 34:38.310
so I'm rebuilding my
erotic art collection.

34:38.310 --> 34:39.630
Well isn't that nice!

34:39.630 --> 34:41.040
Well, I'll see you later...

34:41.670 --> 34:44.100
There's a shadowy auction goin' on tonight,

34:44.100 --> 34:47.220
and a legendary piece by
Katsushika Hokusai is on the list.

34:47.640 --> 34:48.660
But wouldn't y'know,

34:48.660 --> 34:51.910
they're holdin' it somewhere
I'm not really welcome.

34:51.910 --> 34:53.430
Ah well, you see...

34:53.430 --> 34:54.910
I saved you, didn't I?

34:54.910 --> 34:57.030
Consider this give-and-take.

35:06.830 --> 35:09.160
Higuchi's there, too...!

35:09.160 --> 35:10.770
I'll wait here! Go on ahead!

35:10.770 --> 35:11.740
I'm beggin' ya!

35:11.740 --> 35:13.610
I'll get ya a nice reward!

35:13.940 --> 35:15.810
I'm countin' on ya! Good luck!

35:16.810 --> 35:18.810
So... What the heck is going on here?

35:18.810 --> 35:20.890
This is a feast for demons,

35:20.890 --> 35:23.450
take care you don't
end up on the menu...

35:23.450 --> 35:25.310
All right, tonight's participants...

35:25.310 --> 35:26.720
If you'll come this way.

35:34.820 --> 35:36.820
This is how Rihaku-san likes it.

35:36.820 --> 35:39.020
What's with the atmosphere here?!

35:51.720 --> 35:54.040
A humble welcome to my festival!

35:54.040 --> 35:56.490
I suppose this is what
you'd call a HOT pot.

35:56.490 --> 35:59.340
If you add some sesame oil,
you'll find it's delicious.

36:03.570 --> 36:04.370
My eyes...!

36:05.870 --> 36:08.910
To whoever lasts the longest at my table,

36:08.910 --> 36:13.540
I shall grant the right to take whichever
book they please off my shelf.

36:13.540 --> 36:16.050
I trust all of you have a choice in mind.

36:16.170 --> 36:20.370
The manuscript of
the Kokinshu!

36:16.900 --> 36:20.370
The diary of Ryusei Kishida
is my white whale.

36:17.890 --> 36:20.360
The Steam Train/Steamship
Trip Guide 1st Edition!

36:18.880 --> 36:20.360
The erotic art
by Hokusai!!!

36:20.430 --> 36:25.440
And this is a picture book belonging to a
certain raven-haired girl when she young.

36:25.440 --> 36:27.990
Have a look, her name is
written right on it.

36:32.430 --> 36:34.760
All right, Romantic Engine,
full speed ahead!

36:34.760 --> 36:36.070
It's Ra Ta Ta Tam...

36:36.070 --> 36:38.440
Not only that, the one
she had as a child, too!

36:38.440 --> 36:41.040
That makes it the most valuable
thing under the heavens!

36:41.830 --> 36:43.200
Now then, your first course...

36:43.200 --> 36:45.640
How about you all begin
with one piece each.

37:01.990 --> 37:04.160
SPICY...!!!

37:21.380 --> 37:22.470
Hey now, little boy!

37:22.470 --> 37:23.690
You mustn't be naughty!

37:24.040 --> 37:25.280
I'm not being naughty!

37:25.280 --> 37:27.130
I'm doing something good here!

37:27.130 --> 37:28.070
Something good?

37:28.470 --> 37:29.710
Hey miss, did you know?

37:30.240 --> 37:32.710
Every book is connected.

37:33.920 --> 37:37.190
For example, that girl has
the entire Sherlock Holmes.

37:37.190 --> 37:38.980
The author, Conan Doyle.

37:38.980 --> 37:41.950
Getting inspiration from
the French author Jules Verne,

37:41.950 --> 37:44.510
he wrote the science-fiction
novel "The Lost World".

37:44.510 --> 37:46.480
Now look at the book over there.

37:46.480 --> 37:51.420
That's Mathias Sandorf, written by Verne
out of respect to Alexandre Dumas.

37:51.420 --> 37:55.500
Dumas' work, "The Count of Monte Cristo", came
to Japan under the name "The Cavern King".

37:55.500 --> 37:58.920
The first to adapt it was Ruiko Kuroiwa
of the Yorozu Morning News.

37:58.920 --> 38:02.430
And he in turn appeared as a character in
the novel "The Meiji Tower of Babel".

38:02.430 --> 38:04.500
The author of that was Futaro Yamada.

38:04.500 --> 38:06.300
In his "War Generation Anti-War Diaries",

38:06.300 --> 38:09.070
Yamada declared the novel
"Oni Fire" to be utter rubbish.

38:09.070 --> 38:10.550
That was written
by Seishi Yokomizo.

38:10.550 --> 38:13.260
He was an editor at the
magazine "Shin Seinen" in his youth,

38:13.260 --> 38:16.660
and his co-editor at the time was On Watanabe, author of "The Androgynous Scion."

38:16.660 --> 38:20.590
Jun'ichiro Tanazaki submitted an article titled
"Harusamu" to honor him after his death.

38:20.590 --> 38:24.140
Tanazaki engaged in fierce literary
dispute with Ryunosuke Akutagawa.

38:24.140 --> 38:26.660
Months after the dispute,
Akutagawa took his own life.

38:26.660 --> 38:30.130
Hyakken Uchida explored the
particulars of this suicide in "Bowler Hat."

38:30.130 --> 38:32.700
This work was then
praised by Yukio Mishima.

38:32.700 --> 38:36.920
At the age of 22, Mishima declared his hatred of Osamu Dazai directly to Dazai's face.

38:36.920 --> 38:40.580
After losing his friend to tuberculosis,
Dazai wrote an article in his memoriam,

38:40.580 --> 38:42.810
the author of that book there,
Sakunosuke Oda.

38:42.810 --> 38:46.780
All books are connected, this Sea of
Used Books is in truth one giant book!

38:47.080 --> 38:49.480
You... What on earth are you?

38:50.290 --> 38:52.470
I'm the God of the Used Book Market!

38:53.520 --> 38:57.980
I offer divine wrath to those who stop
the flow of books by locking them away,

38:57.980 --> 39:00.950
my duty is to return those books
back to the sea they came from!

39:01.760 --> 39:04.350
And that's why I'd like
you to help me, miss.

39:17.280 --> 39:19.550
You're certainly packing it away!

39:19.550 --> 39:22.550
If you tire of the hot pot,
we also have ramen and gyoza!

39:35.710 --> 39:38.780
Don't you think it's
about time you gave up?

39:39.390 --> 39:41.170
Right back at you.

39:42.320 --> 39:46.760
Perhaps it's best to quit if you're
hallucinating rainbow streamers...

39:46.760 --> 39:49.740
I bet you're seeing them too,
why not worry about yourself?

39:50.960 --> 39:52.260
I had already forgotten pain.

39:52.260 --> 39:53.920
My consciousness had grown dim.

39:53.920 --> 39:56.740
Intent only on defeating
the hot pot in front of me,

39:56.740 --> 39:58.350
I was now a perpetual motion machine.

39:58.350 --> 40:00.670
You're persistent, aren't you...

40:00.670 --> 40:04.710
No one yet's been able to
hold out as long as I have...

40:05.290 --> 40:08.240
I'm starting to hallucinate things like this.

40:10.620 --> 40:13.070
My hallucination's not
going to lose to yours!!!

40:37.540 --> 40:39.270
Bravo!

40:39.270 --> 40:41.440
Young man, you are the victor!

40:41.440 --> 40:42.840
Take your book and go!

40:52.590 --> 40:54.760
Thank you so, so much...

40:58.310 --> 40:59.440
Huh?!

41:00.370 --> 41:01.700
What's this?

41:03.530 --> 41:06.020
It is I, God of the Used Book Market!

41:06.020 --> 41:07.610
That kid!!!

41:07.880 --> 41:10.940
Imprudent collector,
reap what you have sown!

41:21.640 --> 41:27.250
- The Steam Train/Steamboat Trip Guide!
- The manuscript for the Kokinshu!!!

41:27.800 --> 41:30.680
If you want them, go trove
the Sea of Used Books!

41:30.850 --> 41:34.890
I believe you'll find them in
appropriate places at appropriate prices.

41:36.660 --> 41:38.650
Damn it all to hell!

41:38.650 --> 41:40.660
My collection!!!

41:48.410 --> 41:51.410
Stop!!! My future is waiting!!!

41:53.040 --> 41:53.950
Isn't that...

41:55.170 --> 41:57.120
...the Senpai I keep bumping into?

41:59.060 --> 42:00.740
Hey, miss! Thanks a lot!

42:00.740 --> 42:02.630
Those books have been resurrected.

42:02.850 --> 42:06.120
I bet you'll come across
Ra Ta Ta Tam any minute now!

42:12.790 --> 42:15.080
Th-This is the diary of Ryusei Kishida!

42:15.080 --> 42:16.090
Why is it here?!

42:16.090 --> 42:18.340
Never mind, I'm so grateful!

42:18.340 --> 42:21.560
-The manuscript of the Kokinshu!
- The Steam Train/Steamboat Trip Guide!

42:22.580 --> 42:23.800
How unfortunate...

42:24.010 --> 42:26.590
To be betrayed by the
God of the Used Book Market.

42:26.590 --> 42:28.060
How utterly annoying.

42:28.060 --> 42:30.090
Then I'll treat you
to yakisoba instead!

42:31.430 --> 42:33.720
Hanuki-san, maybe you best go home...

42:33.720 --> 42:35.530
This way!

42:36.110 --> 42:37.490
- Hey ho...
- Hey ho...

42:37.490 --> 42:39.230
- Hey ho!
- Hey ho!

42:43.580 --> 42:44.280
What's this?

42:44.280 --> 42:45.790
Guerrilla theater.

42:45.790 --> 42:48.200
It's time for the School Festival already?

42:48.360 --> 42:50.800
The Eccentric King! Scene 47!

42:52.260 --> 42:55.940
You there! Are you Jogasaki,
the head of the Film Club Misogi?

42:55.940 --> 42:57.820
How dare you address me without "-san"!

42:57.820 --> 42:59.780
Tell me your name this instant!

42:59.780 --> 43:01.710
I am Princess Daruma!

43:01.710 --> 43:04.910
I'm searching for the Eccentric King,
now tell me where he is!

43:04.910 --> 43:06.970
No, Kaori!!!

43:07.100 --> 43:08.320
You bitch...

43:08.580 --> 43:09.800
That's utterly low!

43:10.880 --> 43:13.730
Kyoto University President's
Special Curry

43:13.770 --> 43:16.790
If I were to cover this thing in curry

43:16.790 --> 43:19.740
and leave it for the Mt. Yoshida stray dogs

43:19.740 --> 43:21.790
Oh, how much fun that would be!

43:21.790 --> 43:25.790
Stop this now, don't you dare
treat Kaori as a mere object

43:25.790 --> 43:27.610
For I do not know

43:27.830 --> 43:31.320
Where to find the Eccentric King

43:31.320 --> 43:34.580
And that is the honest truth

43:34.580 --> 43:35.910
However...!

43:35.910 --> 43:36.960
However?

43:37.560 --> 43:40.590
- If you don't spit it out...
- Stop, please!!!

43:40.590 --> 43:44.020
Oh, my beloved Eccentric King

43:44.020 --> 43:46.430
Where can I find him now

43:46.430 --> 43:49.730
The School Festival Executive Director knows...

43:49.730 --> 43:51.560
The Executive Director knows?

43:51.800 --> 43:54.180
Your compatriot in Breast Rock Climbing,

43:54.180 --> 43:56.820
your friend from the
Bedchamber Investigation Team?

43:56.820 --> 43:59.230
Yes, the one who gave me
handholds shaped like breasts,

43:59.230 --> 44:01.620
my friend and rival in Breast Rock Climbing!

44:01.620 --> 44:03.670
My junior in the Bedchamber Investigation Team,

44:03.670 --> 44:06.500
The School Festival Executive Director knows...

44:06.900 --> 44:09.680
You, with your obsessive clean freak tendencies

44:09.680 --> 44:12.620
You who will never accept
intimacy with real flesh and blood!

44:12.620 --> 44:15.440
Acknowledge the filthiness of your own soul

44:15.440 --> 44:16.900
And apply some bleach

44:17.510 --> 44:20.470
Finally, I know the villain

44:20.710 --> 44:23.630
The mastermind is revealed

44:23.630 --> 44:28.980
My enemy is none other than the
School Festival Executive Director!

44:28.710 --> 44:30.360
Kaori!!!

44:32.440 --> 44:33.480
Take it down, guys!

44:33.480 --> 44:34.240
Hey ho!

44:34.240 --> 44:35.400
Stop right there!

44:35.400 --> 44:37.790
Guerrilla theater is a violation of the rules!

44:38.040 --> 44:39.230
- Hey ho!
- Hey ho!

44:39.230 --> 44:41.230
You public moral flouting scoundrels!

44:41.230 --> 44:42.470
Stop!

44:45.430 --> 44:48.870
It appears that your presence has
extended the night somewhat.

44:49.090 --> 44:51.610
I'll watch over Hanuki,
you can be on your way.

44:51.970 --> 44:53.610
We'll meet at the School Festival.

44:53.610 --> 44:54.190
Okay!

44:54.190 --> 44:56.660
And I recommend buying
some ajari-mochi on your way.

44:56.660 --> 44:58.830
It's quite delicious when it's fresh.

45:05.130 --> 45:08.280
And so, I made my way
towards the School Festival.

45:09.070 --> 45:11.120
This night was far from over!

45:13.790 --> 45:16.950
A school festival is a high
pressure bargain sale of youth --

45:16.950 --> 45:18.890
A Midnight Market of Youthfulness!

45:18.160 --> 45:19.780
Ra Ta Ta Tam Shop

45:19.780 --> 45:21.790
No Touching

45:20.300 --> 45:21.280
A picture book?

45:21.280 --> 45:22.530
There's just one?

45:22.960 --> 45:23.780
Hey, now!

45:23.780 --> 45:25.500
No window shopping.

45:26.310 --> 45:28.250
There were no more obstacles in my path!

45:28.250 --> 45:30.790
I'd obtained a key item
needed to enter the citadel.

45:30.790 --> 45:33.810
All I needed to do now was wait for
the raven-haired maiden to appear!

45:33.810 --> 45:35.250
This is Ra Ta Ta Tam!

45:35.250 --> 45:36.500
Such a coincidence!

45:37.020 --> 45:40.030
This is no coincidence!
This is inevitability!

45:40.030 --> 45:41.330
And thus we'd finally talk...

45:41.330 --> 45:43.410
About love, about our futures!

45:43.410 --> 45:46.110
My long battle is on the
verge of drawing to a close!

45:46.110 --> 45:49.710
Already I smile and grow nostalgic
upon reflection of this journey...

45:49.710 --> 45:50.910
- Over there!
- Hey ho!

45:50.910 --> 45:52.840
Hey, stop it!
Don't you "Hey ho" me!

45:52.840 --> 45:55.410
What are you doing?!
That was my stall, damn it!

45:55.610 --> 45:56.680
Wait!

45:56.680 --> 45:58.490
The Eccentric King!

45:58.490 --> 45:59.460
Hey!

46:01.500 --> 46:03.110
Damn it, they're quick...

46:03.110 --> 46:04.580
What the heck was that about?

46:04.580 --> 46:06.480
You! We group up at headquarters!

46:06.920 --> 46:10.310
They're a School Festival terrorist
group intent on guerrilla theater.

46:10.310 --> 46:14.500
They steal the frameworks of unpopular
festival stalls and use them to build stages.

46:14.500 --> 46:16.170
Their play is "The Eccentric King."

46:16.170 --> 46:17.970
It's an adventure musical,

46:17.970 --> 46:20.670
about Princess Daruma's search
for the eponymous king.

46:19.690 --> 46:25.680
Eccentric King Stage Locations

46:20.880 --> 46:23.540
Revelations about students
and clubs are woven into the story,

46:23.540 --> 46:25.120
making a mix of truth and fiction,

46:25.120 --> 46:29.100
and those who've had their dirty secrets
revealed have fallen hard from grace.

46:29.100 --> 46:32.680
Leaving this group unchecked for so long
has placed our reputation on the line!

46:32.680 --> 46:34.780
The Eccentric King must be stopped!

46:34.780 --> 46:36.920
We must return order to the School Festival!

46:36.920 --> 46:37.660
Yes, sir!

46:41.810 --> 46:42.720
Director!

46:44.350 --> 46:47.130
Director, what should we do
about the Swift-Footed Kotatsu?

46:47.130 --> 46:48.940
That's lower on the priority list.

46:49.710 --> 46:56.470
Swift-Footed Kotatsu Locations

46:50.880 --> 46:53.830
However, they're treating
passerbys to helpings of hot pot!

46:53.830 --> 46:56.470
Left unchecked,
food poisoning is a possibility...

46:56.920 --> 46:57.940
I'll leave that to you.

46:59.770 --> 47:00.930
Must be rough...

47:01.500 --> 47:04.820
My goodness, everyone everywhere
is running roughshod!

47:06.470 --> 47:07.350
You're sick?

47:07.620 --> 47:10.480
I picked it up at
another of my affairs...

47:14.510 --> 47:16.250
Congratulations!

47:17.220 --> 47:19.660
Your prize is this red carp backpack!

47:20.690 --> 47:23.400
Just put your arms
through here to wear it!

47:23.500 --> 47:23.970
Here!

47:24.760 --> 47:25.810
Cool, ain't it!

47:25.810 --> 47:27.650
My back was now nice and warm!

47:27.650 --> 47:30.990
To get this red carp just
as I was getting chilly...

47:30.990 --> 47:32.340
Three cheers for opportunism!

47:32.500 --> 47:33.490
Hail and amen!

47:35.320 --> 47:37.310
Truly, this was a theater of youth.

47:37.300 --> 47:39.300
Over 18 Only!
Jogasaki's Cherished Love Doll!

47:37.570 --> 47:40.770
There were so many splendid works
by talented students on display...

47:39.300 --> 47:41.800
Mr. Jogasaki's Breast Rock Climbing!

47:40.770 --> 47:44.110
Each flowed by like illustrations
from some fantastic picture book.

47:41.800 --> 47:42.800
Kyoufuku Railways

47:42.800 --> 47:44.310
Pretty Girl Crane Game

47:50.010 --> 47:50.920
You sure can drink!

47:50.920 --> 47:51.820
I'm not done yet!

47:51.810 --> 47:57.070
Rice Fundamentalists vs. Bread Alliance
Rice! Or Wheat!

47:51.880 --> 47:54.120
Well, what about cookies!
Those are like bread!

47:54.120 --> 47:57.340
If you believe that nonsense,
then rice crackers are a type of rice!

47:57.540 --> 48:00.040
My, that's a splendid red carp you have.

48:00.370 --> 48:01.300
Higuchi-san!

48:01.300 --> 48:03.060
This time it's a warm kotatsu, huh?

48:03.370 --> 48:05.070
Would you care for some hot pot?

48:05.280 --> 48:07.610
We're on the run from the
School Festival Executive.

48:07.830 --> 48:09.210
The stakes sure have risen...

48:09.860 --> 48:11.270
Please put your mind at ease.

48:11.270 --> 48:12.900
While my underwear remains on,

48:12.900 --> 48:14.580
I shall not go under the kotatsu.

48:14.580 --> 48:15.340
How admirable.

48:15.600 --> 48:17.970
Such is the etiquette
required of Don Underwear.

48:18.360 --> 48:21.850
He's about to undertake
the greatest battle of his life.

48:22.020 --> 48:23.160
Please, watch and enjoy!

48:23.160 --> 48:27.500
I shall be leading the entire School
Festival to a happy ending for sure!

48:27.850 --> 48:30.130
Still, not having changed
underwear for so long,

48:30.130 --> 48:32.250
I'm surprised you're even still alive...

48:32.660 --> 48:34.520
I did immediately get sick.

48:34.520 --> 48:36.380
But yet I still heartily live!

48:36.730 --> 48:38.150
It's the Swift-Footed Kotatsu!

48:38.150 --> 48:39.380
Hold it right there!

48:39.790 --> 48:40.830
Time to go...

48:42.730 --> 48:44.080
- Hey ho...
- Hey ho...

48:44.080 --> 48:45.200
- Hey ho!
- Hey ho!

48:45.200 --> 48:46.380
Stop!

48:50.380 --> 48:51.700
Over here!

48:58.060 --> 49:00.410
The Princess isn't coming!
She's been caught!

49:00.410 --> 49:01.180
Already?!

49:01.180 --> 49:02.640
There's no backup!

49:02.640 --> 49:03.650
You do it, then!

49:03.650 --> 49:04.400
Heck no!

49:04.400 --> 49:05.260
Hey, you!

49:05.260 --> 49:06.350
You wanna be an actress?

49:06.350 --> 49:07.480
Whatever, you're doing it.

49:07.480 --> 49:08.470
Here's your script!

49:12.150 --> 49:13.810
We can feed you your lines, too.

49:15.800 --> 49:17.650
Unnecessary! I've memorized it all.

49:19.250 --> 49:21.500
I shan't tuck my tail
between my legs and run!

49:21.500 --> 49:24.210
It must be fate that I've been
handed such a major role!

49:24.210 --> 49:26.560
I've resolved to follow my
thread of fate until the end!

49:28.350 --> 49:32.200
You got your cold from that
Obscene Investigation Team, did you not?

49:32.200 --> 49:34.060
It's not the Obscene Investigation Team!

49:34.060 --> 49:35.570
The Bedchamber Investigation Team!

49:35.790 --> 49:37.970
Bedchamber, you mean a lady's bedroom!

49:38.190 --> 49:40.890
Investigation there is done only
by the indecent and shameless!

49:40.890 --> 49:43.220
The name Depraved Director suits you well!

49:44.710 --> 49:49.000
That reprehensible sickness you bear

49:49.250 --> 49:53.860
To such baseness, I shall never yield

49:54.510 --> 49:56.170
Until the day

49:56.170 --> 49:58.890
My beloved Eccentric King

49:58.890 --> 50:01.520
I lay eyes on you again

50:01.530 --> 50:03.730
That Eccentric King of yours

50:03.730 --> 50:07.240
Imprisonment was his fate

50:07.240 --> 50:09.630
Never again set to return

50:09.630 --> 50:11.880
Neither his name nor his ideals

50:11.880 --> 50:14.670
Even if the path I follow

50:14.670 --> 50:17.970
Should lead me straight to the depths of hell

50:18.400 --> 50:23.820
Never shall I become plagued by doubt or fear

50:23.820 --> 50:27.410
Ever onward, I'll press forward

50:28.070 --> 50:31.550
If it's for the sake of the Eccentric King!

50:33.010 --> 50:34.420
The Eccentric King Players!

50:34.420 --> 50:36.510
Performing a play here violates the rules!

50:36.510 --> 50:38.610
- Surrender yourselves quietly!
- Take it down, guys!

50:39.150 --> 50:41.010
Let the show go on,
you pain-in-the-ass!

50:41.010 --> 50:43.310
Don't give me your cold,
Depraved Director!

50:43.310 --> 50:44.410
Stop this!

50:44.410 --> 50:45.820
Out of my way!

50:45.820 --> 50:47.600
Again?!

50:49.300 --> 50:51.800
Why are you always front stage center?!

50:51.800 --> 50:53.780
They escaped our clutches once again!

50:54.280 --> 50:56.180
They have an 11th leading lady!

50:56.640 --> 50:59.800
Go ahead and keep catching us!
Our reserves are limitless!

51:00.170 --> 51:03.220
Be that as it may, the latest
one is lacking in acting ability.

51:03.440 --> 51:05.370
It seems you must be running out.

51:06.470 --> 51:07.530
However, it's strange!

51:07.530 --> 51:09.540
The script appears freshly written,

51:09.540 --> 51:11.500
but we have yet to find the author!

51:12.830 --> 51:15.970
If we capture the author,
continuing the play will be an impossibility.

51:15.970 --> 51:16.920
Where are they...

51:17.800 --> 51:18.490
Director!

51:19.090 --> 51:20.160
Hey, Director!

51:21.830 --> 51:23.960
We've just intercepted a text message!

51:23.970 --> 51:25.990
- That's private!!!
- It's the latest script!

51:25.990 --> 51:27.820
We've confiscated their new lyrics!

51:28.680 --> 51:30.920
Also, this poster was amongst the data!

51:31.170 --> 51:32.080
What on earth...

51:32.380 --> 51:33.810
The final scene is up next!

51:33.810 --> 51:35.360
A Love Scene Grand Finale?

51:35.590 --> 51:37.540
L-L-L-Love Scene?!

51:37.540 --> 51:38.840
But where?!

51:39.040 --> 51:41.380
Please watch this security footage!

51:42.310 --> 51:43.500
The Swift-Footed Kotatsu...

51:49.980 --> 51:50.880
Wait, what's that?

51:52.120 --> 51:53.110
A daruma?

51:53.110 --> 51:55.110
Forgotten by the Swift-Footed Kotatsu?

51:55.350 --> 51:56.690
If we rewind...

52:00.730 --> 52:02.050
So that's what's going on!

52:02.590 --> 52:04.090
How could I not have noticed?

52:04.090 --> 52:06.300
You! Bring up the Eccentric King map!

52:07.130 --> 52:09.200
Now overlay the Swift-Footed Kotatsu map!

52:10.820 --> 52:12.280
It's a perfect match!

52:12.480 --> 52:14.440
So the ringleaders of
"The Eccentric King",

52:14.440 --> 52:16.170
they write the script at the kotatsu,

52:16.170 --> 52:19.320
and once they move, the troupe
performs at their old location!

52:20.450 --> 52:21.170
Shit...

52:21.170 --> 52:24.130
The Swift-Footed Kotatsu is on the
move through the courtyard!

52:26.280 --> 52:28.430
It's Higuchi and Don Underwear!

52:28.430 --> 52:30.710
- The Don...?!
- Depraved Director!!!

52:31.730 --> 52:34.080
Everyone everywhere is
running roughshod...!!!

52:34.350 --> 52:35.780
Chase that kotatsu!

52:35.780 --> 52:38.580
Don Underwear must not
take the stage at all costs!!!

52:43.940 --> 52:45.030
What's up next?

52:45.030 --> 52:46.960
Well, there's a love scene up next,

52:46.960 --> 52:48.820
between you and Don Underwear.

52:48.820 --> 52:49.660
You fine with that?

52:49.990 --> 52:51.400
I may have no experience,

52:51.400 --> 52:54.390
but I'm ready and willing
to answer drama's call!

52:54.730 --> 52:58.940
Don Underwear put on this play to
search for an unrequited love.

52:58.940 --> 53:01.030
If this play becomes hot topic on campus,

53:01.030 --> 53:03.290
his Apple Girl will definitely come watch!

53:03.290 --> 53:06.360
Don Underwear will lay his
feelings bare once she appears!

53:06.520 --> 53:08.360
The fact the King and
the Princess can't meet,

53:08.360 --> 53:10.650
it's a metaphor for his current situation!

53:10.650 --> 53:14.100
There's no way she won't respond
to the Don's feelings of love!

53:14.100 --> 53:15.600
Then that means for sure!

53:15.600 --> 53:18.680
Until our Apple Girl appears,
the show must go on!

53:20.830 --> 53:23.000
Our connection to the
kotatsu's been leaked!

53:23.000 --> 53:25.290
They'll most likely be
expecting us on the roof!

53:25.550 --> 53:27.090
Tactics O!

53:30.820 --> 53:31.960
There!

53:34.440 --> 53:36.200
If the troupe isn't stopped,

53:36.200 --> 53:39.330
she'll have a love scene in
public with Don Underwear...

53:39.330 --> 53:40.360
This is bad!!!

53:40.360 --> 53:43.320
This is most definitely NOT
the script written in my heart!

53:44.160 --> 53:46.640
Never mind, if I can
just make it to the stage,

53:46.640 --> 53:48.260
I can trade places with the Don...!

53:48.930 --> 53:50.740
The two of us finally being united,

53:50.740 --> 53:52.360
that's drama of the highest order!

53:53.260 --> 53:55.090
Director! We know the kotatsu's location!

53:56.940 --> 53:59.130
My Romantic Engine doesn't
have enough horsepower!

53:59.130 --> 54:01.360
I'm gonna lose MY
final act if this keeps up!

54:02.260 --> 54:03.540
Naoko-san!!!

54:03.540 --> 54:08.280
Naoko-san, I'll Wait For You
Until My Dying Day

54:08.280 --> 54:09.400
Bit-part...

54:11.660 --> 54:13.980
Romantic Engine,
Activate Pure Love Nitro!

54:13.980 --> 54:16.080
If she's tonight's leading lady,

54:16.080 --> 54:18.330
then damn straight I'm going
to be the leading man!

54:20.910 --> 54:22.960
Hey, your belt's all twisted!

54:24.060 --> 54:25.340
Let me fix that for you.

54:28.350 --> 54:31.000
The only thing twisted here
is my love-struck heart!

54:31.000 --> 54:31.910
What are you doing?!

54:31.910 --> 54:33.400
This isn't what you promised!

54:33.400 --> 54:35.540
The girl takes priority over everything else!

54:35.540 --> 54:37.410
That promise is about 5th on my list!

54:51.080 --> 54:53.000
Where's the Eccentric King?!

54:53.660 --> 54:56.990
That was quite the hustle,
yet this isn't the finish line.

54:56.990 --> 54:59.060
The final scene is taking place over there.

55:04.890 --> 55:05.970
The Eccentric King!

55:05.970 --> 55:06.720
Begin!

55:11.300 --> 55:14.990
The Eccentric King

55:14.990 --> 55:19.700
Has vanished, nowhere to be found

55:19.700 --> 55:21.700
And the world

55:21.700 --> 55:25.990
Has been plunged in grief

55:25.990 --> 55:28.570
Yet this time, for sure,

55:28.570 --> 55:34.050
My journey is almost at its end!

55:34.050 --> 55:38.990
This time, for sure...

55:45.890 --> 55:48.540
One day, on a bench

55:49.300 --> 55:51.180
I had taken seat

55:51.180 --> 55:54.670
And you had taken seat nearby

55:55.060 --> 55:57.740
And then, from up above

55:58.470 --> 56:00.370
A rain of apples

56:00.370 --> 56:02.720
And at the moment I saw you

56:02.720 --> 56:05.170
You looked my way as well!

56:05.170 --> 56:06.930
And then, on both our heads...

56:07.310 --> 56:09.630
Out of nowhere, a thump!

56:10.710 --> 56:12.100
Two apples...

56:12.100 --> 56:13.650
Out of nowhere, a thump.

56:14.110 --> 56:16.770
Such a twist of fate

56:17.500 --> 56:19.100
This divine revelation

56:19.100 --> 56:22.770
At that moment, I knew it was love!

56:20.750 --> 56:22.590
Th-That's...!

56:23.170 --> 56:25.230
I adore you

56:25.230 --> 56:28.300
My destined love

56:28.420 --> 56:30.230
Princess...

56:30.230 --> 56:32.260
- Daruma...
- This is a festival of fools.

56:32.270 --> 56:34.250
Keep watching and
you'll become one, too.

56:34.510 --> 56:35.980
If I'm going to be a fool anyway,

56:36.790 --> 56:37.850
Then I'll...

56:38.620 --> 56:41.250
...be a DANCING fool!

56:46.780 --> 56:48.280
Something's caught on the net!

56:48.280 --> 56:49.400
Raise it up!

57:08.730 --> 57:09.730
Music!

57:14.710 --> 57:18.350
I happened to be passing through by chance

57:18.350 --> 57:21.160
But to be able to meet you like this

57:21.160 --> 57:24.480
Is such a marvelous joy

57:23.490 --> 57:24.480
Who's this idiot?!

57:24.480 --> 57:27.450
I'm just a poor seller of Ra Ta Ta Tam

57:26.720 --> 57:27.450
Get lost!

57:27.450 --> 57:29.750
And so, my raven-haired maiden

57:30.560 --> 57:34.390
It is I, the Senpai you often meet

57:32.840 --> 57:34.360
What's this crap?!

57:34.400 --> 57:34.980
The hell?!

57:34.980 --> 57:37.740
Senpai, such a coincidence

57:37.740 --> 57:39.310
No, simply by chance!

57:39.710 --> 57:41.330
Such a coincidence

57:41.330 --> 57:42.320
No, just by chance!

57:42.320 --> 57:43.280
A coincidence

57:43.280 --> 57:44.110
By chance!

57:44.110 --> 57:45.110
- Coinci...
- Chance!

57:45.110 --> 57:45.950
- Coin...
- Chance!

57:45.950 --> 57:46.990
-Co...
- ...ance!

57:46.990 --> 57:51.690
I suppose, then, it must be fate!

57:52.800 --> 57:54.400
Well, time for the kiss.

57:54.400 --> 57:55.970
But this isn't how she really feels...

57:55.970 --> 57:58.410
It's a play, it's out of
dramatic necessity!

57:59.740 --> 58:00.700
Senpai?

58:02.740 --> 58:05.720
I am the one, the leading man

58:05.720 --> 58:08.220
This play's grand conspirator

58:08.220 --> 58:10.910
A disruption, quite unexpected

58:10.910 --> 58:13.370
Just jammed up the works

58:13.370 --> 58:16.040
But please, forget about that now

58:16.040 --> 58:18.640
Keep your eyes focused on me!

58:18.640 --> 58:23.890
Ah! My darling, lovely Apple Girl!

58:23.890 --> 58:26.490
If you're out there, out there somewhere,

58:26.490 --> 58:30.960
Then please, won't you now take the stage!

58:29.680 --> 58:30.960
I suppose you mean me?

58:41.490 --> 58:44.730
Isn't it strange, a coincidence

58:44.730 --> 58:47.500
A thunderclap under blue sky

58:47.500 --> 58:50.720
That once again, in this place

58:50.720 --> 58:53.590
I should lay my eyes on you

58:53.590 --> 58:56.700
Destiny layered in destiny

58:56.700 --> 58:59.620
To think that I, just like you

58:59.620 --> 59:02.760
Had been waiting, oh so long

59:02.760 --> 59:05.740
My person of destiny

59:05.740 --> 59:11.710
By heaven's decree, it's you, Don Underwear!

59:13.640 --> 59:15.900
A-Apple Girl...

59:15.900 --> 59:17.960
It's you...!

59:18.570 --> 59:19.610
Apologies.

59:19.950 --> 59:22.380
Consider yourself caught!

59:23.440 --> 59:24.430
Underwear!

59:24.430 --> 59:26.010
You public moral flouting scoundrel!

59:26.010 --> 59:27.940
I'm the School Festival Executive Director!

59:28.730 --> 59:31.060
Your beloved Apple Girl
was a mere disguise,

59:31.060 --> 59:32.950
an idol I dress up as
for my own amusement!

59:32.950 --> 59:34.780
Though I must apologize for the deceit.

59:46.780 --> 59:48.810
Am I

59:49.230 --> 59:51.200
Just no good

59:52.150 --> 59:54.780
My dear Don Underwear

59:54.780 --> 59:57.800
You were always, always on my mind

59:58.090 --> 01:00:00.110
Always have I

01:00:00.110 --> 01:00:03.480
Been left staring at your back

01:00:03.480 --> 01:00:08.400
Supporting you this entire time

01:00:09.560 --> 01:00:11.930
However

01:00:11.930 --> 01:00:14.850
In your heart

01:00:14.850 --> 01:00:17.770
There lives someone different

01:00:17.770 --> 01:00:22.000
If all you desire is a woman of beauty

01:00:22.000 --> 01:00:24.820
Then cosmetic surgery

01:00:24.820 --> 01:00:30.130
Even that, I would consider

01:00:30.330 --> 01:00:32.500
Won't you please just look my way!

01:00:32.500 --> 01:00:34.180
Do it!

01:00:34.480 --> 01:00:35.940
Look her way!

01:00:36.340 --> 01:00:38.090
Get lost, Depraved Director!

01:00:38.340 --> 01:00:40.090
Go to your Bedchamber!

01:00:42.630 --> 01:00:44.410
I'm sorry, but

01:00:44.410 --> 01:00:47.090
That's something I just can't do

01:00:47.090 --> 01:00:49.660
What I fell in love with

01:00:49.660 --> 01:00:53.990
Was not a face, but the thump of an apple

01:00:53.990 --> 01:00:56.900
It was at that moment

01:00:56.900 --> 01:01:01.450
I knew that my fate had been sealed

01:01:02.000 --> 01:01:04.130
Even if

01:01:04.130 --> 01:01:06.210
My beloved

01:01:06.210 --> 01:01:08.700
Should happen to be a man

01:01:08.700 --> 01:01:11.120
This heartbeat of mine

01:01:11.120 --> 01:01:14.500
It can tell no lies

01:01:16.840 --> 01:01:19.680
You're always going on
about the damn romantic!!!

01:01:19.680 --> 01:01:21.580
Look at the girl standing in front of you!

01:01:37.740 --> 01:01:41.080
I'm not quite as heartless as people say I am

01:01:41.080 --> 01:01:44.420
I long for nothing more than
someone to cure my loneliness

01:01:44.420 --> 01:01:47.960
Yet I am the one in charge,
the Executive Director

01:01:47.960 --> 01:01:49.520
There is no one

01:01:49.520 --> 01:01:52.360
Who could ever understand me

01:01:54.640 --> 01:01:57.980
Yet if you were willing to take me in your arms

01:01:57.980 --> 01:02:03.050
Then in that case, for you, a woman I can be!

01:02:05.570 --> 01:02:06.860
You delirious from fever?!

01:02:06.860 --> 01:02:08.540
You're taking opportunism too far!

01:02:23.450 --> 01:02:24.930
Just get this over with...!

01:02:24.930 --> 01:02:26.190
Just play some music...!

01:02:26.490 --> 01:02:28.280
No! Don't drop the curtain!

01:02:28.280 --> 01:02:30.890
Seeking another's warmth to
cure transitory loneliness!

01:02:30.890 --> 01:02:32.570
Utterly... Preposterous!!!

01:02:42.700 --> 01:02:44.780
Yuko! Jirokichi!

01:02:44.780 --> 01:02:47.270
My koi...!

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:56.050
These koi

01:02:56.050 --> 01:02:58.230
Have birthed a new love

01:02:58.580 --> 01:03:02.630
This time for sure, a destined love

01:03:02.920 --> 01:03:06.960
Love, ever fickle

01:03:07.170 --> 01:03:11.170
Love, ever selfish

01:03:11.650 --> 01:03:15.920
But at the end I've finally met you

01:03:15.920 --> 01:03:20.400
My one and true destiny

01:03:22.250 --> 01:03:26.620
The story, as always, is opportunism

01:03:26.620 --> 01:03:31.080
Finally, you looked my way

01:03:31.080 --> 01:03:35.070
I know that you

01:03:31.320 --> 01:03:32.580
They're alive...

01:03:32.580 --> 01:03:34.040
I know they're alive...!

01:03:35.070 --> 01:03:39.250
You are my destined love

01:03:39.890 --> 01:03:51.610
In our rose-colored campus life!

01:04:01.430 --> 01:04:03.740
Before I'd realized it,
I had caught a cold.

01:04:07.340 --> 01:04:10.320
 - Haven't seen anyone in two weeks
- Some tamagozake would clear this up
- My fridge is empty (T_T)


01:04:07.740 --> 01:04:11.110
I muttered out my symptoms on
social media but got no response.

01:04:11.540 --> 01:04:12.820
Was everyone still out?

01:04:12.820 --> 01:04:15.510
Or was the thought of associating
with me too unbearable.

01:04:16.200 --> 01:04:19.460
An evening that seemed to encompass
every season had left me beat...

01:04:19.460 --> 01:04:21.870
I doubt I'll be putting away
my bed for some time.

01:04:26.110 --> 01:04:31.110
"Alone", by Yumeji Takehisa
I wait for one one, no one waits for me

01:04:34.480 --> 01:04:36.400
I wait for no one, no one waits for me...

01:04:36.770 --> 01:04:39.140
I wait for no one, no one waits for me!!!

01:04:42.110 --> 01:04:45.560
If you're making tamagozake,
leave out the egg and the sugar...

01:04:45.560 --> 01:04:46.710
Not going to happen.

01:04:46.710 --> 01:04:49.550
You're sick because you
allowed your spirit to falter.

01:04:49.550 --> 01:04:51.080
You should follow my example.

01:04:51.080 --> 01:04:54.140
Higuchi, you didn't catch a
cold because you're an idiot.

01:04:54.380 --> 01:04:57.800
Although I'll admit I'm happy
you dropped by to see me...

01:04:57.800 --> 01:05:01.790
If I was laid up with no visitors,
I would likely starve to death.

01:05:01.790 --> 01:05:03.770
Though I'm afraid I
can't offer much help...

01:05:03.770 --> 01:05:05.470
Thank goodness she's here, too.

01:05:06.750 --> 01:05:08.630
This is a lot tastier than I'd expected!

01:05:08.630 --> 01:05:09.980
So, how is everyone else?

01:05:09.980 --> 01:05:12.500
It seems like the entire
city is fighting off a cold...

01:05:12.760 --> 01:05:15.590
If you go outside,
it's almost like a ghost town.

01:05:15.800 --> 01:05:18.270
You must be tough if you
haven't caught it yet!

01:05:18.270 --> 01:05:21.880
If we had some Junpero,
this epidemic would be over in an instant.

01:05:22.510 --> 01:05:26.800
The legendary wonder drug used in the
treatment of tuberculosis ages ago...

01:05:26.800 --> 01:05:30.540
When it's swirled on a stick like candy,
one lick can lower any fever.

01:05:30.540 --> 01:05:33.310
One's body is fulled to the
brim with vitality once more.

01:05:33.900 --> 01:05:36.380
That's right! Rihaku-san
would have some for sure!

01:05:36.380 --> 01:05:38.570
I sense another profitable venture ahead...

01:05:48.270 --> 01:05:49.790
Oh no, Don Underwear!

01:05:51.600 --> 01:05:53.040
Ah... Hey...

01:05:53.570 --> 01:05:55.400
I'm wearing new underwear...

01:05:55.400 --> 01:05:56.910
F-Finally...

01:05:57.000 --> 01:05:58.290
Are you all right?!

01:05:58.650 --> 01:06:00.350
Noriko-kun's cold...

01:06:00.750 --> 01:06:02.450
It's an awful beast...

01:06:02.660 --> 01:06:04.340
I'm off to see her...

01:06:04.890 --> 01:06:06.420
That's mutual destruction!

01:06:06.420 --> 01:06:07.880
I'll go with you!

01:06:08.650 --> 01:06:10.400
There's nothing better if you're sick!

01:06:10.830 --> 01:06:14.080
Cola has secret ingredients inside,

01:06:14.080 --> 01:06:15.980
and they work well on colds...

01:06:15.980 --> 01:06:18.300
If you add some ginger, too...

01:06:19.300 --> 01:06:21.530
The effect is increased a hundredfold...

01:06:34.250 --> 01:06:35.200
Delicious...

01:06:35.450 --> 01:06:37.650
My mother taught me how to make it.

01:06:38.330 --> 01:06:40.560
I'd rather the Don not
feel too humiliated,

01:06:40.560 --> 01:06:42.320
so keep this our little secret.

01:06:42.780 --> 01:06:44.300
Thanks for going out of your way...

01:06:45.100 --> 01:06:47.700
But you need to dress
warmer or you'll get sick, too!

01:06:47.700 --> 01:06:49.080
Take one of my sweaters, at least.

01:06:49.080 --> 01:06:49.920
I'll be fine!

01:06:49.920 --> 01:06:50.830
Of course not!

01:06:51.930 --> 01:06:54.240
Those round cushions are really cute...

01:06:54.740 --> 01:06:56.700
Yeah, but I bought a ton...

01:06:57.010 --> 01:06:58.670
But squeezing them feels so nice,

01:06:59.050 --> 01:07:00.080
AND they're fun, too.

01:07:01.060 --> 01:07:04.170
You know, it's a waste if I'm the
only eating your tamagozake.

01:07:04.170 --> 01:07:06.170
Could you bring some to the Director?

01:07:06.170 --> 01:07:08.920
He's all by himself, so he's
probably feeling forlorn.

01:07:09.120 --> 01:07:10.290
Certainly!

01:07:10.750 --> 01:07:13.810
And bring some Ginger Cola with you, too...

01:07:16.210 --> 01:07:18.190
Apologies for making
you go out of your way...

01:07:18.600 --> 01:07:21.660
As you can see, my new
popularity is burying me alive.

01:07:21.660 --> 01:07:24.190
So many people sent you gifts!

01:07:24.460 --> 01:07:26.190
My performance in that musical,

01:07:26.190 --> 01:07:28.440
it brought me a lot of new
fans from across campus.

01:07:28.740 --> 01:07:30.910
So please, don't concern
yourself with me.

01:07:31.220 --> 01:07:35.330
However, since I seem to have
given my cold to most of my guests,

01:07:35.330 --> 01:07:36.700
it does pain my heart somewhat.

01:07:37.230 --> 01:07:38.650
The one I'm most worried about,

01:07:38.650 --> 01:07:41.680
it's my Senpai from the Bedchamber
Investigation Team, Todo-san.

01:07:42.000 --> 01:07:43.880
His daughter has yet to visit him,

01:07:43.880 --> 01:07:46.750
and he must be lonely
wrapped up in bed by himself.

01:07:47.060 --> 01:07:47.920
I'll go visit him.

01:07:48.110 --> 01:07:48.800
Really?

01:07:49.210 --> 01:07:50.570
There's some apples over there,

01:07:50.570 --> 01:07:52.200
would you mind bringing some with?

01:07:52.200 --> 01:07:53.940
An apple a day and all that...

01:07:53.940 --> 01:07:54.580
Yes!

01:07:54.580 --> 01:07:58.440
A tornado ruined the crop last year,
but this year it's been quite the harvest.

01:07:58.850 --> 01:08:01.640
I also received a bunch of hats,
so please, help yourself.

01:08:02.050 --> 01:08:04.420
Your ears do look quite cold.

01:08:06.180 --> 01:08:08.370
So, what happened afterwards?

01:08:08.690 --> 01:08:10.440
With the Senpai you keep bumping into,

01:08:10.440 --> 01:08:12.440
on the stage of the Eccentric King.

01:08:12.450 --> 01:08:13.360
That was...!

01:08:13.360 --> 01:08:15.450
He was just passing through by chance.

01:08:15.690 --> 01:08:18.810
Really now! That was
quite the hijack he pulled.

01:08:18.810 --> 01:08:20.540
He is my friend, after all,

01:08:20.540 --> 01:08:22.960
and that was the first time
I'd ever seen him so frantic.

01:08:23.580 --> 01:08:25.070
But I suppose you wouldn't understand.

01:08:25.470 --> 01:08:28.980
You always press forward, paying no
mind to those left in your wake.

01:08:29.130 --> 01:08:31.360
The fact you bumped
into him so frequently...

01:08:31.360 --> 01:08:32.850
You didn't find it strange?

01:08:33.480 --> 01:08:36.380
Up to this point, I had given
myself over to wonder,

01:08:36.380 --> 01:08:38.540
following the road
wherever it lead.

01:08:38.540 --> 01:08:42.730
I had been lax in forging the tactics
required for romantic relationships,

01:08:42.730 --> 01:08:45.290
and noticing the feelings of
others was quite beyond me.

01:08:45.290 --> 01:08:50.120
I suppose trying to grasp my own fluffy
cotton-candy feelings was difficult as well.

01:08:50.120 --> 01:08:54.300
But, when I remember Senpai wrapping his
arms around my papier mache costume,

01:08:54.300 --> 01:08:55.900
something inside of me goes "Pop!",

01:08:55.900 --> 01:08:58.480
and I want nothing more
than to glomp my red carp.

01:09:00.500 --> 01:09:02.800
Yahoo!

01:09:02.800 --> 01:09:05.200
Did I actually manage
to achieve anything?

01:09:05.530 --> 01:09:08.370
It was all just my
imagination, wasn't it...

01:09:08.520 --> 01:09:10.810
Yahoo...

01:09:14.380 --> 01:09:15.760
Even coughing -- I am alone.
Ozaki Hosai

01:09:18.720 --> 01:09:21.620
What dragged you
all the way out here?

01:09:21.950 --> 01:09:24.770
The Executive Director
told me where you live.

01:09:25.070 --> 01:09:26.780
I thought he was pissed at me...

01:09:26.780 --> 01:09:28.590
I did give him this cold, after all.

01:09:28.590 --> 01:09:31.210
It seems he was more worried
about you than himself.

01:09:31.520 --> 01:09:35.390
My daughter did come to visit,
but she ended up gettin' my cold...

01:09:35.390 --> 01:09:38.370
I bet she's gonna pass it on to
her husband and her new in-laws...

01:09:38.370 --> 01:09:40.780
Heck, you might end up gettin' it too.

01:09:40.780 --> 01:09:43.130
It seems the God of Colds
and I are on the outs.

01:09:43.130 --> 01:09:44.420
For pete's sake...

01:09:44.420 --> 01:09:46.570
Here you are lookin' out for me again.

01:09:47.780 --> 01:09:51.100
Hey, I met some kid searchin' for
some old book at the market,

01:09:51.100 --> 01:09:52.210
he your Senpai?

01:09:52.210 --> 01:09:54.620
He wanted some lousy kid's
book called Ra Ta Ta Tam...

01:09:54.620 --> 01:09:57.810
Seems he wanted to get
his hands on it at any cost.

01:09:57.980 --> 01:10:00.820
Even though I begged him to
get me that piece of erotic art...

01:10:01.200 --> 01:10:04.720
Whatever, I ended up gettin'
my hands on it anyway.

01:10:04.720 --> 01:10:08.540
Oh yeah, not for nothin',
I got this cold from Rihaku-san.

01:10:08.540 --> 01:10:11.730
He already had it back
at your drinking contest,

01:10:11.730 --> 01:10:14.270
and it sounds like it's
only got worse since then.

01:10:22.720 --> 01:10:23.520
Oh!

01:10:23.520 --> 01:10:25.920
Why are the streets so deserted today?

01:10:25.920 --> 01:10:29.020
This cold lays in ambush attacking
anyone who approaches.

01:10:29.020 --> 01:10:32.590
I thought the world got destroyed
while I was wrapped up in bed.

01:10:33.800 --> 01:10:35.220
Oh, you won't believe this!

01:10:35.220 --> 01:10:37.320
Higuchi-kun finally got sick, too!

01:10:41.320 --> 01:10:43.610
I had planned on visiting Rihaku-san,

01:10:43.610 --> 01:10:45.770
but the closer I got,
the more the wind lost mercy.

01:10:45.770 --> 01:10:49.020
Alas, my attempt at the
journey was left in tragic defeat.

01:10:49.020 --> 01:10:50.740
This is no mere common cold...

01:10:50.740 --> 01:10:54.300
This retrovirus gone rampant is
none other than the Rihaku Cold!

01:10:54.300 --> 01:10:57.010
May I ask you where Rihaku-san lives?

01:10:57.010 --> 01:11:00.170
He parks his train in an isolated
area by Takaragaike Lake,

01:11:00.170 --> 01:11:02.370
where winds are constantly gushing out.

01:11:02.370 --> 01:11:05.170
The God of Colds inside of
Rihaku sends forth its minions,

01:11:05.170 --> 01:11:07.790
and the wind sends them
swirling through Kyoto!

01:11:07.790 --> 01:11:11.440
If we do nothing, this ends in double
suicide between Kyoto and Rihaku!

01:11:12.030 --> 01:11:14.850
I'm on my way to go visit Rihaku-san now!

01:11:15.230 --> 01:11:17.600
Look what happened to
Higuchi when he tried!

01:11:17.600 --> 01:11:21.450
There must be some reason the God of
Colds wants nothing to do with me...

01:11:21.450 --> 01:11:22.860
This must be fate as well.

01:11:22.860 --> 01:11:25.850
There's something I must go
tell Rihaku-san in person!

01:11:46.280 --> 01:11:48.290
Apologies for dropping in so late!

01:11:48.670 --> 01:11:50.040
Rihaku-san!

01:11:50.260 --> 01:11:51.920
Rihaku-san!!!

01:11:54.010 --> 01:11:54.980
Rihaku-san!

01:11:54.980 --> 01:11:58.130
I'm on my deathbed...

01:11:58.130 --> 01:12:00.200
You mustn't give in so easily!

01:12:01.220 --> 01:12:03.470
It seems you haven't changed...

01:12:04.060 --> 01:12:07.730
How many decades have passed
since our drinking contest...

01:12:11.400 --> 01:12:12.910
It hasn't been that long.

01:12:12.910 --> 01:12:15.010
It was only a few hours ago,
this very night!

01:12:15.010 --> 01:12:17.140
Then I suppose that's good.

01:12:17.140 --> 01:12:19.440
Time in isolation flies like an arrow,

01:12:19.440 --> 01:12:22.280
it seemed like vast expanses
of time had gone by....

01:12:23.740 --> 01:12:25.390
On such a lonely winter's night,

01:12:25.390 --> 01:12:28.420
I'm weeping like an infant
with a soiled diaper.

01:12:28.420 --> 01:12:31.260
No matter how much I wail,
my mother doesn't appear...

01:12:31.260 --> 01:12:32.740
But yet I'm here!

01:12:32.960 --> 01:12:37.050
I used to love collecting and
trading valuable milk caps.

01:12:37.050 --> 01:12:40.090
In Sevens, I loved ensuring play
can't continue past 6 or 8,

01:12:40.090 --> 01:12:43.340
and I reveled in drinking in
everyone's troubled faces.

01:12:43.340 --> 01:12:47.230
My parents wanted little to
do with me, but I had money,

01:12:47.230 --> 01:12:49.770
and with money came friends.

01:12:49.770 --> 01:12:51.470
Then women, then more money.

01:12:51.470 --> 01:12:52.620
However...

01:12:52.620 --> 01:12:55.520
There were those who stole
what I had through brute force,

01:12:55.520 --> 01:12:57.740
and in the end I had nothing.

01:12:57.740 --> 01:13:00.820
I knew then the world was a scramble,
full of nothing but taking...

01:13:01.140 --> 01:13:03.450
But strength, that could be
bought with money too.

01:13:03.450 --> 01:13:04.920
So could love.

01:13:04.920 --> 01:13:07.380
There is nothing on earth
that money can't buy.

01:13:07.380 --> 01:13:08.290
Yet...

01:13:08.290 --> 01:13:11.410
No matter how much I collected,
my heart remained unfulfilled.

01:13:11.680 --> 01:13:13.790
Rihaku-san, you're not alone.

01:13:13.790 --> 01:13:16.040
Of course you're connected to others!

01:13:16.440 --> 01:13:19.180
The money you loaned out to
people became their strength,

01:13:19.180 --> 01:13:22.460
and after having their fun,
they returned to you once again.

01:13:22.750 --> 01:13:25.360
Your cold was first transferred to Hanuki-san,

01:13:25.360 --> 01:13:27.250
then to Todo-san and the Director,

01:13:27.250 --> 01:13:29.650
The Don, Noriko-san, and all their friends,

01:13:29.650 --> 01:13:31.780
and then to friends of those friends...

01:13:31.780 --> 01:13:33.870
It's spreading all throughout the city!

01:13:33.870 --> 01:13:35.580
The things you stole,

01:13:35.580 --> 01:13:38.800
they bounced from one place to the next,
bringing happiness with them.

01:13:43.210 --> 01:13:45.180
Even as you profess your isolation,

01:13:45.180 --> 01:13:47.490
you're still to bound to others in the end.

01:13:47.490 --> 01:13:49.480
The thread of fate you weave with,

01:13:49.480 --> 01:13:51.700
everyone is connected to,
whether they like it or not.

01:13:52.240 --> 01:13:54.880
Rihaku-san, you're absolutely not alone!

01:13:55.240 --> 01:13:58.000
This evening was all thanks to you...

01:13:58.000 --> 01:14:00.100
A long and wondrous,
marvelous night!

01:14:05.900 --> 01:14:07.390
Thank you...

01:14:17.250 --> 01:14:18.890
Thanks to you, Rihaku-san,

01:14:18.890 --> 01:14:20.940
I had such a wonderful evening.

01:14:21.400 --> 01:14:24.080
The Fake Denki Bran was quite delicious.

01:14:24.080 --> 01:14:25.170
So...

01:14:25.170 --> 01:14:27.170
Shall we have some more, then?

01:14:27.800 --> 01:14:29.950
I'll drink until there's nothing left.

01:14:33.550 --> 01:14:34.530
What's that?

01:14:34.910 --> 01:14:39.280
It appears there's a virus out
there even worse than what I had...

01:14:39.280 --> 01:14:41.120
A terminal case if I ever saw one.

01:14:41.330 --> 01:14:45.930
A young man is struggling with
isolation to a greater degree than I did.

01:14:45.930 --> 01:14:48.440
Would you perhaps have
an idea who it could be?

01:14:48.770 --> 01:14:51.340
Now that I think of it,
someone does come to mind...

01:14:51.340 --> 01:14:53.960
Do you remember the
story Ra Ta Ta Tam?

01:14:53.960 --> 01:14:57.020
That small white train
had a destination in mind...

01:14:57.020 --> 01:15:00.500
Just as you have a final
station to approach as well.

01:15:00.940 --> 01:15:01.570
Yes!

01:15:01.760 --> 01:15:03.630
The dawn is drawing near...

01:15:03.940 --> 01:15:05.940
The night is short!

01:15:05.940 --> 01:15:08.250
Walk on, young girl!

01:15:11.130 --> 01:15:14.740
This cold medicine will cure the incurable!

01:15:14.740 --> 01:15:15.970
It's Junpero!

01:15:17.500 --> 01:15:20.000
Destination

01:15:18.660 --> 01:15:25.020
Life is indeed short, my dear

01:15:25.020 --> 01:15:32.030
So, young lady, do fall in love

01:15:33.630 --> 01:15:35.740
Nothing changed after
coming to university.

01:15:35.740 --> 01:15:38.530
All that came were grades that
held no promise for the future.

01:15:38.530 --> 01:15:40.800
I could delay the
inevitable with grad school,

01:15:40.800 --> 01:15:42.800
but it'll all end in
a job hunt, anyway.

01:15:43.080 --> 01:15:44.990
Not clever, not talented.

01:15:44.990 --> 01:15:47.490
Not financially stable,
not strong, not determined.

01:15:47.490 --> 01:15:51.540
Not charismatic, not a charming piglet
boy one wants to rub cheeks with.

01:15:52.000 --> 01:15:53.870
Just an eternal string of "I'm nots".

01:15:53.870 --> 01:15:56.290
There's no way I can
make it in this world.

01:15:57.540 --> 01:16:00.540
Where Is My Talent Hidden?

01:15:57.550 --> 01:16:01.120
Spending all that time rushing about
wondering where my talent lies...

01:16:00.540 --> 01:16:06.040
A Skilled Hawk Hides Its Talons

01:16:01.120 --> 01:16:03.550
It's almost like back
when I was a freshman,

01:16:03.550 --> 01:16:06.050
I stored away a talent
piggy bank in my closet.

01:16:06.280 --> 01:16:07.800
Wait, did that really happen?!

01:16:07.800 --> 01:16:08.840
It must have!

01:16:17.860 --> 01:16:20.230
Everyone Starts Somewhere...
So Just Start

01:16:18.420 --> 01:16:19.520
Everyone quiet!

01:16:20.230 --> 01:16:30.740
Why Are We Now Stuck On
"The Eternal Obstacle Removing Plan"?

01:16:20.230 --> 01:16:21.760
It's been a year since we met her!

01:16:21.760 --> 01:16:25.500
We were on the verge of
removing every obstacle in our path,

01:16:25.500 --> 01:16:28.640
so why do we now have the
"Eternal Obstacle Removing Plan"?

01:16:27.950 --> 01:16:30.200
We could not ascertain
her true feelings!

01:16:30.200 --> 01:16:31.880
A detestable lack
of determination!

01:16:31.470 --> 01:16:33.820
Our good name is in ruins,
we need to revise!

01:16:33.300 --> 01:16:36.000
Revise? As in claim we
no longer desire her?

01:16:35.480 --> 01:16:37.420
If we do, our good
name is preserved!

01:16:36.890 --> 01:16:38.320
I can't acknowledge this!

01:16:37.610 --> 01:16:41.160
We claim to be head over heels,
yet we know nothing about her!

01:16:40.410 --> 01:16:44.240
Nothing apart from the image of the
back of her head seared into our retinas.

01:16:43.780 --> 01:16:45.420
We use the girl as an excuse!

01:16:45.420 --> 01:16:47.940
A coward's plot to
fill the abyss in our heart!

01:16:47.940 --> 01:16:49.320
We should all be ashamed!

01:16:48.780 --> 01:16:50.120
We must grovel before her!

01:16:49.580 --> 01:16:53.220
Fine, go get all red-faced
and pouty like a damn daruma.

01:16:53.220 --> 01:16:55.060
Don't be swept away by the tide!

01:16:55.060 --> 01:16:58.350
The world holds a prejudice that
students must have sweethearts!

01:16:58.350 --> 01:17:01.070
Thus, we foolish students hold that to heart,

01:17:01.070 --> 01:17:02.920
and recklessly rush for social status,

01:17:02.920 --> 01:17:05.310
and then unnaturally,
we all have sweethearts!

01:17:05.310 --> 01:17:08.340
In that case, all we do is
encourage that same prejudice!

01:17:07.250 --> 01:17:09.770
I oppose! Resolutely!

01:17:08.340 --> 01:17:10.780
All we want is to no
longer to be alone!

01:17:10.120 --> 01:17:12.090
Coward! Grit your teeth!

01:17:10.260 --> 01:17:13.640
All we do is run away since
we can't predict the future!

01:17:12.220 --> 01:17:15.000
We need to find
out how she feels!

01:17:13.930 --> 01:17:16.300
But we must do it as
discreetly as possible!

01:17:16.300 --> 01:17:18.080
Let me in there!!!
I gotta take part!!!

01:17:18.080 --> 01:17:21.150
Stop this! We must
think rationally!

01:17:20.280 --> 01:17:24.050
Are we even capable of
something as delicate as dating?

01:17:23.820 --> 01:17:25.000
Dating, sounds fun...

01:17:24.460 --> 01:17:26.930
All you want us to do
is cop a feel or two!

01:17:26.930 --> 01:17:29.680
You mean to say our mind
is that utterly obscene?

01:17:28.930 --> 01:17:31.000
Yes, our mind does
hold some indecency,

01:17:31.000 --> 01:17:32.730
but that's not
all it holds!

01:17:32.250 --> 01:17:34.300
So many other things,
even beautiful things!

01:17:34.330 --> 01:17:35.340
OPEN THE DAMN DOOR!

01:17:35.340 --> 01:17:37.750
What if we get smashed
to smithereens?

01:17:37.220 --> 01:17:39.520
As if we could arrange
a date in the first place!

01:17:39.520 --> 01:17:42.930
If she had drawn close that night,
could we have even handled it?

01:17:42.040 --> 01:17:44.760
She wouldn't! She's not
some sleazy instant ramen girl!

01:17:44.250 --> 01:17:47.560
So if she invited us to cop a feel,
we would have refused?

01:17:47.380 --> 01:17:48.420
Perhaps not...

01:17:48.270 --> 01:17:50.680
How many times have
you looked, you lech?

01:17:50.530 --> 01:17:52.060
We must bow and repent!

01:17:51.710 --> 01:17:54.590
Go get your kicks from
feeling up rubber balls then!

01:17:54.450 --> 01:17:56.040
Fallacious, utterly fallacious...

01:17:56.120 --> 01:17:57.840
Why do we idolize her, anyway?!

01:17:57.840 --> 01:17:58.740
Why her?!

01:17:58.740 --> 01:18:01.300
Make a convincing argument
if we're to continue!

01:18:01.300 --> 01:18:03.200
Coward!

01:18:01.740 --> 01:18:03.200
Betrayer!

01:18:02.200 --> 01:18:03.200
Fool!

01:18:02.640 --> 01:18:03.200
Pervert!

01:18:03.200 --> 01:18:04.190
Thoughtless!!!

01:18:03.630 --> 01:18:04.190
Reckless!!!

01:18:04.190 --> 01:18:05.370
Everyone quiet!

01:18:05.640 --> 01:18:07.040
Gentlemen, however!

01:18:07.040 --> 01:18:09.080
If we're having this
thorough of a discussion,

01:18:09.080 --> 01:18:11.560
let us consider how
relationships even start.

01:18:11.560 --> 01:18:15.700
Gentlemen, this pure start to love you
all seek doesn't exist to begin with!

01:18:15.700 --> 01:18:19.410
The more we mull over and
analyze every possible component,

01:18:19.410 --> 01:18:21.960
the more our feet get
rooted, frozen in place!

01:18:21.960 --> 01:18:25.720
Lust, vanity, fad, delusion, foolishness...
we become utterly engulfed!

01:18:25.720 --> 01:18:28.450
There comes a time when we
must risk leaping into darkness,

01:18:28.450 --> 01:18:31.120
even if we end up plunging
into the hell of heartbreak!!!

01:18:31.120 --> 01:18:32.440
As if we could
really do it!

01:18:32.290 --> 01:18:34.160
If we don't jump, our future is clear!

01:18:34.160 --> 01:18:37.930
We'll just continue to spin in circles
in some corner of our wasted youth!!!

01:18:37.930 --> 01:18:40.250
We will never lay bare our feelings for her!

01:18:40.250 --> 01:18:43.460
I ask, if we died tomorrow, would
any of you truly have no regrets?!

01:18:43.460 --> 01:18:45.370
If so, step forward right now!!!

01:19:16.360 --> 01:19:19.360
The girl is on her way.
I told her where you live.

01:19:27.060 --> 01:19:27.860
It can't be...

01:19:32.370 --> 01:19:35.210
That young lady will be
here any moment now.

01:19:36.690 --> 01:19:38.680
A Girl Who Goes to
Visit All Her Sick Friends?

01:19:40.680 --> 01:19:41.680
Fushimi

01:19:41.680 --> 01:19:44.470
Visiting Naoko and Her Husband

01:19:41.680 --> 01:19:44.520
Swimming up the stream of the night's events,

01:19:44.520 --> 01:19:47.290
I visited everyone wishing for their quick recovery,

01:19:44.840 --> 01:19:47.220
A Feverish Passion Without the Fever

01:19:47.290 --> 01:19:50.280
but they worried for me as much as I did for them,

01:19:48.840 --> 01:19:51.810
She Receives Some Boiled Kabocha

01:19:50.280 --> 01:19:53.290
and in the end they sent me off bearing several gifts.

01:19:53.520 --> 01:19:57.070
I did feel left out since I was the only one not sick...

01:19:53.560 --> 01:19:56.320
Visiting Akagawa With Lots of
Rhetoric Club Members

01:19:56.320 --> 01:19:58.320
The Girl Recieves Dried Plums

01:19:57.330 --> 01:19:59.310
It was an odd sort of loneliness.

01:20:00.340 --> 01:20:02.830
The Couple at the Bookstore Feel Better

01:20:00.530 --> 01:20:01.640
If I wouldn't be alone,

01:20:01.640 --> 01:20:04.270
I felt that perhaps a cold wouldn't be so bad.

01:20:04.270 --> 01:20:05.830
She Receives Asadaame Cough Drops

01:20:05.860 --> 01:20:10.070
Kantaro, the Boy of the North Winds!

01:20:10.090 --> 01:20:11.330
A Big Success!!

01:20:11.840 --> 01:20:13.810
She's getting closer by the second!

01:20:13.160 --> 01:20:15.010
She's on her way here?!

01:20:14.570 --> 01:20:15.620
Take shelter!!!

01:20:14.860 --> 01:20:17.080
Maybe we SHOULD
just open the gates?

01:20:16.270 --> 01:20:18.960
You dare suggest exposing
her to our filthy soul?!

01:20:18.110 --> 01:20:19.840
The best defense
is offense!

01:20:19.690 --> 01:20:21.340
Activate the
Defensive Shutdown!

01:20:20.590 --> 01:20:22.610
But she DID come
all this way...

01:20:22.380 --> 01:20:23.800
We're just not ready!

01:20:23.010 --> 01:20:25.080
We will NEVER be ready!

01:20:24.980 --> 01:20:26.050
Return the obstacles!!!

01:20:26.050 --> 01:20:27.580
Don't panic, gentlemen!

01:20:27.580 --> 01:20:28.360
Calm down!

01:20:33.610 --> 01:20:35.700
We have to keep the gates sealed!!!

01:20:36.380 --> 01:20:39.870
Open up! We're taking over!!!

01:20:40.480 --> 01:20:43.000
You, get the HELL OUT!!!

01:20:44.160 --> 01:20:45.520
We're breaking through!

01:20:45.520 --> 01:20:48.050
We'll spread our arms open
wide and invite her in!!!

01:20:48.540 --> 01:20:50.910
- Where the hell's the switch?
- Stop it!!!

01:20:55.080 --> 01:20:57.240
This area is under Defensive Shutdown.

01:20:57.240 --> 01:20:58.720
This area --

01:21:08.000 --> 01:21:11.650
Just give your body over to instinct!

01:21:14.040 --> 01:21:16.110
Quick!!! Hide!!!

01:21:16.930 --> 01:21:18.220
Senpai?

01:21:19.080 --> 01:21:21.770
Where on earth are you?

01:21:29.980 --> 01:21:31.240
Senpai!

01:21:31.460 --> 01:21:33.470
Where on earth are you?

01:21:33.470 --> 01:21:34.580
Buy us some time!

01:21:34.580 --> 01:21:37.250
- How'm I gonna do that?
- Whatever, just DO something!!!

01:22:39.810 --> 01:22:42.140
- Senpai...
- Master! Get ready to jump!

01:22:42.140 --> 01:22:44.320
No, no!!! I'm just not ready yet!

01:22:44.320 --> 01:22:46.700
What'll happen if I die?!

01:23:28.250 --> 01:23:30.210
Master! You have to go now!

01:23:30.210 --> 01:23:32.200
I don't wanna...!!!

01:23:32.200 --> 01:23:34.160


01:23:34.160 --> 01:23:36.920
Shoot! Shoot her down now!

01:24:12.240 --> 01:24:14.570
You flew down to save me!

01:24:15.260 --> 01:24:16.980
Yeah, I guess I finally did!

01:24:18.160 --> 01:24:19.130
Senpai!

01:24:19.130 --> 01:24:21.320
Shouldn't we be looking
at this wondrous scenery?

01:24:21.320 --> 01:24:23.310
I'm already looking at something wondrous!

01:24:23.310 --> 01:24:27.540
Besides, this is the only way
wings shaped like these can fly!

01:24:41.060 --> 01:24:42.340
Are you all right?

01:24:42.340 --> 01:24:43.720
Y... Yeah...

01:24:43.720 --> 01:24:45.710
I guess... I'm getting there...

01:24:45.710 --> 01:24:48.750
You weren't quite lucid
but I came up anyway.

01:24:48.920 --> 01:24:49.950
Apologies...

01:25:01.860 --> 01:25:02.780
Wait, is that...?

01:25:03.610 --> 01:25:04.900
Ra Ta Ta Tam!

01:25:08.130 --> 01:25:10.440
You can take it if you'd like.

01:25:11.280 --> 01:25:14.420
This is exactly the one
I had when I was young!

01:25:14.420 --> 01:25:16.730
This is my name written on here!

01:25:17.170 --> 01:25:19.340
Well, I just happened upon it by chance.

01:25:20.420 --> 01:25:21.780
Thank you so, so much...

01:25:30.680 --> 01:25:32.160
I'll treasure it forever...

01:25:33.070 --> 01:25:34.740
You did come all this way.

01:25:35.290 --> 01:25:37.600
I was just passing through by chance...

01:25:38.760 --> 01:25:41.070
Well, that's quite a coincidence.

01:25:47.100 --> 01:25:49.850
Oh yeah, I hear there's a great
used book shop close by...

01:25:50.460 --> 01:25:52.220
Perhaps, we could go together...

01:25:52.220 --> 01:25:53.580
Gladly!

01:26:01.240 --> 01:26:02.520
A cold...

01:26:02.520 --> 01:26:04.520
It seems I've caught a cold, too.

01:26:11.600 --> 01:26:13.380
What if she doesn't come?

01:26:13.380 --> 01:26:15.090
Wait, what if she DOES come?

01:26:15.090 --> 01:26:18.050
I want to go back to those carefree
days I was removing obstacles!!!

01:26:19.780 --> 01:26:23.730
I'm ashamed to admit I couldn't
sleep past 6 this morning.

01:26:23.940 --> 01:26:28.140
He had suggested we go for coffee
before we went to the used book shop.

01:26:28.520 --> 01:26:31.490
Hey wait, is this actually a date?!

01:26:32.460 --> 01:26:34.290
After gathering my scattered thoughts,

01:26:34.290 --> 01:26:36.200
I finally found a thread of conversation.

01:26:36.400 --> 01:26:38.940
In truth, there was something
I wanted to ask her!

01:26:39.820 --> 01:26:43.500
Just what kind of night she had in Pontocho...

01:26:43.860 --> 01:26:45.080
At the used book market...

01:26:45.080 --> 01:26:46.410
The school festival...

01:26:46.410 --> 01:26:47.970
Visiting the sick...

01:26:47.970 --> 01:26:50.130
Just what was she doing that whole time?

01:26:51.310 --> 01:26:54.060
A mysterious night that
seemed to span an entire year...

01:26:54.060 --> 01:26:57.280
If she would be kind enough to
tell me about her exploits,

01:26:57.280 --> 01:26:59.770
I would respond with
the memories of mine.

01:27:00.210 --> 01:27:04.090
That's right, there's something
I really wanted to ask Senpai!

01:27:04.340 --> 01:27:07.940
Just what kind of night he had in Pontocho...

01:27:08.180 --> 01:27:09.420
At the used book market...

01:27:09.420 --> 01:27:10.610
The school festival...

01:27:10.610 --> 01:27:11.840
Sick in bed...

01:27:11.840 --> 01:27:15.100
Just where he traveled to on
that mysterious night...

01:27:15.100 --> 01:27:17.290
That's what I'd really like to find out!

01:27:22.530 --> 01:27:23.720
Welcome!

01:27:34.450 --> 01:27:36.220
For us to have met like this...

01:27:37.530 --> 01:27:38.930
It must have been fate!

01:27:42.980 --> 01:27:46.020
That girl kicked her skateboard

01:27:46.020 --> 01:27:48.890
And went flying down Main Street

01:27:48.910 --> 01:27:51.730
The lazy darkness shines bright

01:27:51.730 --> 01:27:54.640
As it slides down into the gutters

01:27:54.640 --> 01:27:57.690
Standing on their tiptoes yet falling short,

01:27:57.690 --> 01:28:00.440
Those boys shake the world

01:28:00.440 --> 01:28:03.500
Platitudes like "Be true to yourself!",

01:28:03.500 --> 01:28:06.190
They tear them up and throw them aside

01:28:06.190 --> 01:28:10.440
Take all of your vague, unprompted sadness

01:28:11.870 --> 01:28:17.060
And jam it down into your knees

01:28:17.600 --> 01:28:22.430
Stand alone out in the wilderness

01:28:23.050 --> 01:28:26.420
Then head off somewhere, staggering to and fro

01:28:26.420 --> 01:28:31.400
Swaying, swaying, keep pressing onward

01:28:31.400 --> 01:28:34.270
No matter where you go

01:28:34.270 --> 01:28:37.300
No matter where you go!

01:28:37.300 --> 01:28:40.180
No matter where you go...

01:28:52.620 --> 01:28:57.050
Let the blazing lights of downtown

01:28:58.460 --> 01:29:03.400
Set fire to the depths of your heart

01:29:04.130 --> 01:29:08.990
Stand alone at the edge of the world

01:29:09.450 --> 01:29:13.230
Head off somewhere, staggering to and fro

01:29:13.230 --> 01:29:17.970
Swaying, swaying, keep pressing onward

01:29:17.970 --> 01:29:20.810
No matter where you go

01:29:20.810 --> 01:29:23.840
No matter where you go!

01:29:23.840 --> 01:29:26.430
No matter where you go...

01:29:28.480 --> 01:29:29.890
After three

01:29:29.890 --> 01:29:31.280
Backwards

01:29:31.280 --> 01:29:33.210
Somersaults

01:29:33.210 --> 01:29:39.490
the sad clown failed to stick the landing

01:29:40.040 --> 01:29:41.320
His face

01:29:41.320 --> 01:29:42.940
Did seem

01:29:42.940 --> 01:29:44.940
Quite clouded

01:29:44.970 --> 01:29:52.850
Like seeing the sky behind a row of fluttering flags

01:29:53.090 --> 01:29:55.470
I guess I'll pray

01:29:56.030 --> 01:29:58.050
For his

01:29:59.020 --> 01:30:01.220
Health and safety

01:30:08.050 --> 01:30:14.080
But still, who's gonna pray for us?

01:30:14.080 --> 01:30:17.340
That girl kicked her skateboard

01:30:17.340 --> 01:30:20.110
And went flying down Main Street

01:30:20.110 --> 01:30:25.680
The distance between us closed before I realized it

01:30:25.920 --> 01:30:29.020
And slowly but surely

01:30:29.020 --> 01:30:31.660
An unexpected future beckons

01:30:31.660 --> 01:30:34.830
So go sing, and go dance!

01:30:34.830 --> 01:30:37.780
La Lu La Lu La!!!

01:30:37.780 --> 01:30:41.880
Take all of your vague unprompted sadness

01:30:43.130 --> 01:30:48.100
And jam it down into your knees

01:30:48.830 --> 01:30:53.620
Stand alone out in the wilderness

01:30:54.180 --> 01:30:58.030
Head out somewhere, staggering to and fro

01:30:58.030 --> 01:31:02.600
Swaying, swaying, keep pressing onward

01:31:02.600 --> 01:31:05.600
No matter where you go

01:31:05.600 --> 01:31:08.560
No matter where you go!

01:31:08.560 --> 01:31:10.900
No matter where you go...

01:31:12.530 --> 01:31:15.520
That girl kicked her skateboard

01:31:15.520 --> 01:31:18.250
And went flying down Main Street

01:31:18.250 --> 01:31:21.240
The lazy darkness shines bright

01:31:21.240 --> 01:31:25.810
As it slides down into the gutters

01:31:25.960 --> 01:31:28.890
La Lu La Lu La...

01:31:28.890 --> 01:31:31.770
La Lu La Lu La!!!

